<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id" />
  <para style="h">LULEVI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk me adek pa Moses ma kilwongo Lulevi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lulevi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lev</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk me adek pa Moses ma kilwongo</para>
  <para style="mt1">LULEVI</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk pa Lulevi opong ki cik malube ki yo me kelo ginatyera wa ki kit kwer mayam tye i lobo pa jo Icrael, ki tic ma ajwaki yam onongo gitiyo malube ki kit cik magi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lubaro ma pire tek i buk man en aye lengo pa Lubanga ma lapore pekeni wa ki kit yo ma dano omyero gubin kwede inyim Lubanga kawore wek gukwo kun pe gituru wat matye ikin gi ki “Lubanga man maleng pa Luicrael ma lapore pekeni.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok mangene mukato kare matye i buk man, nonge i cura 19:18, en aye lok ma Yecu olwongo ni obedo cik madit me aryo ni: “Mar lawoti macalo imare keni.”</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Cik ma mako mic ki ginatyera <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 1:1-7:38">1:1—7:38</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wiro Aron ki awobene macalo ajwaki <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 8:1-10:20">8:1—10:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cik ma mako kwer ikom gin maleng ki ikom gin ma keni <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 11:1-15:33">11:1—15:33</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nino me koko dano ki i bal <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 16:1-34">16:1-34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cik mamiyo dano bedo ma opore i kwo ki me woro Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="LEV 17:1-27:34">17:1—27:34</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Gitum awanga matye olu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />Rwot olwongo Moses ci oloko kwede ki i Kema me Rwate kun waco ni, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />“Lok bot jo Icrael kun iwaco botgi ni, ka dano mo ikinwu kelo tyer mo bot Rwot, ci bikelo gityere me lee makwo ma okwanyo ki ikin dyangine nyo ki ikin romi ki dyegine.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />Kace dano mo okwanyo gityere me gitum awanga ki ikin dyangi, ci en bityero twon ma kome pe kimwonyo; en bityero i dogola Kema me Rwate, wek Rwot ogame. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />En biketo cinge iwi gitum awanga, ci Lubanga bigamone pire me lakok dano ki i bal ki ikome. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Ci en bineko twon meno inyim Rwot ci awobe pa Aron ma gin aye ajwaki pa Lubanga gibityero remo; gibicoro remo ikom keno tyer matye i dogola Kema me Rwate kun rumu twok keno ducu. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />En biyango gitum awanga, bingido woko matinotino, <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />ka awobe pa ajwaka Aron gibimoko mac iwi keno tyer, kun gicano yen imac kikore. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Ci awobe pa Aron ma gin aye ajwaki gibicano ringo ma kingidoni kikore kacel ki wic ki dwolo, iwi yen matye imac ma iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Ento jam iye ki tyene ducu kibilwokogi ki pii. Ajwaka biwango woko ducu ki bere i keno tyer wek obed gitum awanga, gityer ma kiwango ki mac, en gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />Kace okwanyo gityere me gitum awanga ki ikin romi nyo dyegi, en bityero nyok ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />En bineko inyim Rwot, tung kumalo me keno tyer; awobe pa Aron ma gin aye ajwaki gibicoro remo ikom keno tyer rumu twoke ducu. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />En bingido woko matinotino, kacel ki wic ki dwolone, ci ajwaka bicanogi kikore iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Ento jam iye ki tyene ducu kibilwokogi ki pii. Ajwaka bityero ducu ki bere kun wango i keno tyer; en aye gitum awanga, gityer ma kiwango ki mac, en gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />Kace gityere bot Rwot obedo winyo me gitum awanga, ci en bikelo amam nyo lutino akuri me gityere. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Ajwaka bikelone i keno tyer ci dwoyo ngute, ka wango woko iwi keno tyer. Ci bionyo remone inget keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />En bikwanyo lacukune ki yece ci onyogi inget keno tyer tung kunyango kama kionyo iye buru; <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />biyecone ki bwome, ento pe bipoko iye. Ajwaka biwango i keno tyer, iwi yen matye i mac; en aye gitum awanga, gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot.”<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Gityer me moko kwon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />“Ka ngat mo okelo gityer me moko kwon me atyera bot Rwot, gityer mere bibedo moko kwon mapwote. En bionyo iye moo, ci keto iye odok angwece, <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />ka en bikelo bot awobe pa Aron ma gin aye ajwaki. Ajwaka bijobo moko kwon mapwoti pong cing acel, kacel ki moo ki odok angwece mere ducu; ci ajwaka biwango man iwi keno tyer; en gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Moko ma odong ki ikom gityer me moko kwon bibedo pa Aron ki awobene; en aye gin maleng makato me gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />Ka ityero gityer me moko kwon ma kitedo i keno, bibedo capat ma tobi pe iye me moko kwon mapwote ma kirubu ki moo, nyo capat marep ma tobi pe iye ma kireyo moo ikomgi. <verse eid="LEV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Kace gityer meri obedo gityer me moko kwon ma kitedo i otako nyonyo, bibedo moko kwon mapwote ma tobi pe iye, ma kirubu ki moo; <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />ka ocek, ibingido iye matinotino ci ionyo iye moo; en aye gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="LEV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />Kace gityer meri obedo gityer me moko kwon ma kitedo i cupuriya, ci ibitedo ki moo ki moko kwon mapwote. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Gityer me moko kwon ma kitimo ki jami magi ibikelo bot Rwot; ka dong kityero bot ajwaka, ci en bikelo iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Ki ikom gityer me moko kwon, ajwaka bikwanyo bute mo manok me nyutuni gityer ducu obedo pa Rwot. Ci ajwaka biwango iwi keno tyer wek obed gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Gin ma odong ki ikom gityer me moko kwon bibedo pa Aron ki awobene; en aye gin maleng makato me gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />Gityer me moko kwon ma kikelo bot Rwot pe wuted ki tobi; pien pe wubiwango tobi nyo moo kic me bedo gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Wutwero kelogi bot Rwot me gityer me wi mwaka, ento pe wubityerogi iwi keno tyer me bedo gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Ibiketo kado i gityer me moko kwon meri ducu; pe ibiweko kado me gicike pa Lubangani bedo pe i gityer me moko kwon meri; myero ityer kado kacel ki gityer meri ducu.<verse eid="LEV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />Ka ityero gityer me moko kwon me kac mukwongo me wi mwaka bot Rwot, ibityero wit ngano manyen ma kicoto, kicelo ki mac. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Ibiketo moo ki odok angwece ikome; en aye gityer me moko kwon. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Ajwaka biwango wit ngano mogo ma kicoto, kacel ki moo ki odok angwece mere ducu. Man binyutu ni gityer ducu obedo pa Rwot. En biwangone iwi keno tye, wek obed gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot.”<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Gityer me berbedo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 7:11-18">Lev 7:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />“Ka dano mo tyero gitum me gityer me berbedo, ka tyero lee ma okwanyo ki ikin twoni dyang nyo ma roya, en bityero inyim Rwot ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />En biketo cinge iwi gityere, ci bineko i dogola Kema me Rwate; awobe pa Aron ma gin aye ajwaki gibicoro remo ikom keno tyer kun rumu twoke ducu. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />En bityero gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot ma okwanyo ki ikom gitum meno me gityer me berbedo, en aye dwolo ma oumu jam iye, ki dwolo ducu matye ikom jam iye, <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />ki olang aryo ducu ki dwolo matye ikomgi matye i pyere, ki okene ki ikom acwiny, ma en bikwanyo woko kacel ki olang aryo. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Awobe pa Aron biwango iwi keno tyer iwi gitum awanga matye iwi yen ma imac; en aye gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />Kace lee ma okelo bot Rwot me gityer berbedo obedo lee ma okwanyo ki ikin romi, ma nyok nyo ma bwong, en bityero ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Ka en omiyo latin romo me gityere, en bityero inyim Rwot, <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />ci biketo cinge iwi gityere, ka dong neko woko inyim Kema me Rwate; ci awobe pa Aron gibicoro remone ikom keno tyer kun rumu twoke ducu. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Lacen en bityero gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot ma okwanyo ki ikom gitum meno me gityer me berbedo, en aye dwolone, ki moo yibe olu, kun kingolo cok ki i oguru cogo ngeye, ki dwolo ma oumu jam iye, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />ki olang aryo ducu, ki dwolo matye ikomgi matye i pyere, ki okene ma ikom acwiny ma en bikwanyo woko kacel ki olang aryo. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Ci ajwaka biwango woko iwi keno tyer, obed cam ma kityero ki mac bot Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />Kace gityere obedo dyel, en bityero inyim Rwot, <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />biketo cinge iwiye, ka dong neko woko inyim Kema me Rwate; ci awobe pa Aron gibicoro remone ikom keno tyer rumu twoke ducu. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Lacen en bityero jami magi ma okwanyo ki ikome gubed gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot, en aye dwolo ma oumu jam iye, ki dwolo ducu ma ikom jam iye, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />ki olang aryo ducu, ki dwolo ma ikomgi matye i pyere, ki okene ma ikom acwiny ma en bikwanyo woko kacel ki olang aryo. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Ajwaka biwangogi iwi keno tyer obed cam ma gityero ki mac, ma ngwece kur. Dwolo ducu bedo pa Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Bibedo cik matwal nio wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu, wa i kabedo ma wubedo iye ducu ni, pe wucam dwolo nyo remo.”<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Gitum me bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ka dano mo obalo ma pe otimo akaka, ikom gin mayam Rwot ocikoni pe gitim, ce otimo acel mo ikin gi; <verse eid="LEV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />kace ajwaka ma ki wiro ki moo aye obalo, kun okelo bal ikom lwak, myero en otyer bot Rwot wod twon ma kome pe kimwonyo pi bal ma en otimo, obed gitum me bal. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />En bikelo wod twon i dogola Kema me Rwate inyim Rwot, biketo cinge iwi twon ci neko woko inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Ajwaka ma ki wiro bikwanyo remo twon manok, ci bitero i Kema me Rwate; <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />bilutu lwet cinge iremo ci bikiro remo tyen abiro inyim Rwot, inyim bongo kicika ma umu Kabedo Maleng. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Ajwaka bireyo remo mukene ikom ten keno angwen me keno tyer me odok ma ngwece kur matye i Kema me Rwate inyim Rwot; remo twon mudonge en bionyo woko ite tedi keno tyer me gitum awanga matye idogola Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />En bikwanyo dwolo ducu ki ikom twon me gitum me bal, dwolo ma oumu jam iye, ki dwolo ducu matye ikom jam iye, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />ki olang aryo ducu ki dwolo matye ikomgi matye i pyere, ki okene ki ikom acwiny ma en bikwanyo woko kacel ki olang aryo, <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />kit macalo gikwanyo ki ikom twon me gityer me berbedo; ci ajwaka biwangogi woko iwi keno tyer me gitum awanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Ento pyen twon ki ringone ducu, kacel ki wiye ki tyene ki jam iye ki wee iye, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />en bitero woko ki bere wa inge gony ikabedo ma kilonyo kama kionyo iye buru, ci biwango iwi yen ki mac; i kabedo kama kionyo iye buru en aye kibiwango iye.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />Ka lwak jo Icrael ducu gutimo bal ma pe gutimo akaka, ce loke pe ongene inyim lwak, kun gutiyo gin mo acel ikom gin ducu mayam Rwot ociko ni pe kitim, ci gutingo alii; <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />ka bal ma gutimoni dong ongene, ci lwak myero otyer wod twon me gitum me bal kun gikelo inyim Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Ludongo pa lwak gibiketo cinggi iwi twon inyim Rwot, ci gibineko twon inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Ajwaka ma ki wiro bitero remo twon manok i Kema me Rwate, <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />ajwaka bilutu lwet cinge i remo ci kiro tyen abiro inyim Rwot inyim bongo kicika. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />En bireyo remo mukene ikom ten keno angwen me keno tyer matye i Kema me Rwate inyim Rwot; remo mudonge en bionyo woko ite tedi keno tyer me gitum awanga matye idogola Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />En bikwanyo dwolone ducu ki ikome ci wango woko iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />En bitiyo ki twon man kit ma onongo otiyo ki twon me gitum me bal; ajwaka bitimo gin me lakok dano ki ibal ci Rwot biweko balgi. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Ci ajwaka bitero twon woko wa inge gony, ci biwango kit macalo en wango ki twon pi bal mere. Man aye gitum me bal pa lwak mucoke.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />Ka laloc mo aye obalo ma pe otimo akaka, kun otiyo gin mo acel ikom gin ducu mayam Rwot Lubangane ociko ni pe kitim, ci otingo alii, <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />ka kimiyo en ongeyo bal ma en otimoni, ci en bikelo dyel pi gityere, nyok ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Biketo cinge iwi dyel, ci neko i kabedo ma kineko iye gitum awanga inyim Rwot; meno aye gitum me bal. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Ajwaka bigwelo remo me gitum me bal ki lwet cinge, ci reyo ikom ten keno angwen me keno tyer me gitum awanga; remo mudonge en bionyo woko ite tedi keno tyer me gitum awanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />En biwango dwolone ducu iwi keno tyer, macalo dwolo me gityer me berbedo. Kitmeno ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome pi bale, ci Rwot biweko bale.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 15:27-28">Wel 15:27-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka ngat mo acel ma ikin lwak obalo ma pe otimo akaka, kun otiyo gin mo acel ikom gin ducu mayam Rwot ociko ni pe gitim, ci otingo alii, <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />ka kimiyo en ongeyo bal ma en otimoni, ci en bikelo dyel pi gityere, bwonge dyel ma kome pe kimwonyo, pi bale ma en otimoni. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />En biketo cinge iwi gitum me bal, ci bineko gitum me bal ikabedo ma kineko iye gitum awanga. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Ajwaka bigwelo remo ki lwet cinge, ci reyo ikom ten keno angwen me keno tyer; remo mudonge en bionyo woko ite tedi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />En bikwanyo dwolone ducu ikit yo acel ma kikwanyo kwede dwolo ki igityer me berbedo, ajwaka biwango iwi keno tyer obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot; kitmeno ajwaka bitimo gin me koke ki ikom bale, ci Rwot biweko bale.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />Nyo ka en mito kelo latin romo me gityere pi gitum me bal, ci en bikelo bwonge ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />En biketo cinge iwi gitum me bal, ci neko i kabedo ma kineko iye gitum awangani. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Ajwaka bigwelo remo me gitum me bal ki lwet cinge, ci bireyone iten keno angwen me keno tyer me gitum awanga; remo mudonge en bionyo woko ite tedi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />En bikwanyo dwolone ducu kit ma kikwanyo dwolo latin romo ki igityer me berbedo, ci ajwaka biwango iwi keno tyer ikom gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot; kitmeno ajwaka bitimo gin me koke ki ikom bale ma en otimoni, ci Rwot biweko bale.”<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />“Ka kilwongo dano mo i ot kot me miyo caden ikom gin ma en oneno nyo ikom gin ma oniang loke, ce pe otucu, ci bal bidok iwiye.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />Ka dano mo ogudu kom gin ma kikwero, kadi bed kom lee tim ma oto, nyo kom lee ma paco ma oto, nyo kom gin ma lak alaka ma oto, kun pe ongeyo, en bene bidoko keni, nongo otingo alii. <verse eid="LEV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />Ka dano mo ogudu gin me kwer ma a ki ikom dano matwero miyo dano doko keni, kun pe ongeyo, ka dong oniang iye, nongo otingo alii. <verse eid="LEV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />Nyo ka dano mo okwongo kwong labongo tamo tere kadi bed pi timo gin mo marac nyo maber nongo otingo alii. <verse eid="LEV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />Ka ngat mo otingo alii, ma otimo bal acel mo ikin magi, ci myero otuc bal ma en otimoni, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />ci okel gitume me tingo alii bot Rwot pi bal ma en otimoni, bwong romo nyo bwong dyel, obed gitum me bal; ci ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome pi bale.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />Ento ka nongo latin romo oloye, ci en bikelo amam aryo nyo lutino akuri aryo bot Rwot me gitume me tingo alii pi bal ma otimoni; acel obed pi gitum me bal, acel pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />En bikelogi bot ajwaka, ci ajwaka bikwongo tyero acel me gitum me bal. Bidwoyo ngute turu woko, ento pe biputo wiye, <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />ci bikiro remo manok me gitum me bal ibut keno me tyer, remo mudonge en bibiyo cwer ite tedi keno tyer; en aye gitum me bal. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Lacen ajwaka bityero me aryone me gitum awanga kit ma kiciko; kitmeno ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome pi bal ma en otimoni, ci Rwot biweko bale.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />Ento ka nongo amam aryo nyo lutino akuri aryo oloye, ci bikelo agwata moko kwon acel me moko mapwote me gityer mere pi bal ma otimo, obed gitum me bal. Pe bionyo iye moo pe bene biketo iye odok angwece, pien obedo gitum me bal. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />En bikelo bot ajwaka, ci ajwaka bijobo pong cing acel obed gin me po ikome, biwangone iwi keno tyer, iwi gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot; en aye gitum me bal. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Kitmeno ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome pi bal ma otimo pi lok mo acel ikom magi, ci Rwot biweko bale. Mudonge bibedo pa ajwaka, macalo kitimo ikom gityer me moko kwon.”<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gitum me tingo alii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Ka dano mo oturu cik pa Lubanga kun otimo bal ma pe otimo akaka ikom mot mo maleng ma myero en omii bot Rwot, en bikelo gitume me tingo alii bot Rwot, nyok ma kome pe kimwonyo ma okwanyo ki ikin romi iwel ma ingolo i cekel me ryal kun ilubu wel ma kimoko, obed gitum me tingo alii. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Dok en biculu wang gin ma en obalo iye ikom mot maleng, kun medo iye acel me abic, ci miyo bot ajwaka. Ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome ki nyok romo me gitum me tingo alii, ci Rwot biweko bale.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />Ka dano mo obalo kun otiyo gin mo acel ikom gin ducu mayam Rwot ociko ni pe kitim, kadi bed pe ongeyo, nongo otingo alii, ci bal bidok iwiye. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />En bikelo bot ajwaka nyok ma kome pe kimwonyo ma okwanyo ki ikin romi, i wel ma kimoko, obed gitum me tingo alii. Ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome pi bal ma opoto iye ma pe me akaka, ci Rwot biweko bale. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />En aye gitum me tingo alii, nongo en otingo alii inyim Rwot.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 5:5-8">Wel 5:5-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />“Dano twero balo kun turu cik pa Rwot, macalo: ka obwolo lawote ikom gin ma con okano bote, nyo gin ma ojengo bote, nyo ka omayo jamine, nyo oburu lawote, <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />nyo onongo gin ma orwenyo ci oloko iye lok goba, kun okwongo iye kwong me goba; nyo otimo gin mo acel ikom gin ducu ma dano gitimo ci gibalo kwede. <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />Ka ngat mo obalo kumeno ci otingo alii, en bidwoko wang gin ma omayoni, nyo gin ma en otero me bura, nyo gin ma onongo kikano bote, nyo gin ma orwenyo ma en onongo, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />nyo gin moni ma en okwongo iye kwong me goba. Bidwoko ducu ki bere, dok bimedo acel me abic ikome, ci miyo bot won jami inino ma en tyero iye gitume me tingo alii. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />En bikelo gitume me tingo alii bot Rwot, nyok ma kome pe kimwonyo ma okwanyo ki ikin romi, iwel ma kimoko, wek obed gitum me tingo alii; bikelo bot ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome inyim Rwot, ci Rwot biweko bale ikom gin moni ki ikom gin ducu ma dano twero tiyo mamiyo gitingo alii.”<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik mukene ikom gityer mapatpat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />“Cik Aron ki awobene ni: Man aye cik me gitum awanga, gitum awanga bibedo ikeno tyer dyewor benebene nio wa odiko, kun mac myero otik lyel iye. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Ajwaka biruku bongo arukane bongo camanini, ci ruku pali camaninine ipyere, ka bijobo buru ma odong ka mac dong owango gitum awanga woko, ci keto inget keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Ka dong en bilunyo bongine woko ruku bongi mukene, ci tero buru woko wa inge gony ikabedo ma kilonyo. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Mac ma iwi keno tyer bibedo kalyel nakanaka, pe myero oto. Ajwaka biwango iye yen i rupiny odiko ducu, bicano gitum iwiye kikore, dok biwango dwolo bene iwiye me gityer me berbedo. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Mac bibedo kalyel iwi keno tyer nakanaka, pe myero oto.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />Man aye cik me gityer me moko kwon. Awobe pa Aron gibityerone inyim Rwot, inyim keno me tyer. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Ajwaka bijobo moko kwon mapwoti pong cing acel ki igityer me moko kwon, kacel ki moone ki odok angwece ma ikom gityer me moko kwon, ci wango iwi keno tyer ma ka wange, wek obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Ma odonge Aron ki awobene gibicamo; gibicamo ma tobi pe iye i kabedo mo maleng, idyekal me Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Pe gibitedo capate ki tobi. Atyeko miyo botgi me bedo dul megi me gityer mera ma kiwango ki mac; en gin maleng makato, calo gitum me bal ki gitum me tingo alii. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Co ducu ma ikin likwayo pa Aron gitwero camo dul man ma kikwanyo ki ikom gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot; en cik ma bibedo matwal wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu. Ngat ma ogudu bidoko maleng.”<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Man aye gityer ma Aron ki awobene gibityero bot Rwot inino ma ki wire iye ki moo: agwata moko kwon acel me moko mapwote, obed gityer me moko kwon me nino acel acel; kibityero nucune odiko ki nucune otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Kibitedo ki moo i otako nyonyo; kibikelo madong kirubu woko maber, ma nongo kingido matinotino calo gityer me moko kwon, kityer obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Ajwaka ma oa ki ikin awobe pa Aron ma kibiwiro ki moo me leyo kakare bityero bot Rwot pi cik ma bibedo matwal; kibiwango ducu ki bere. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Gityer me moko kwon pa ajwaka kibiwango woko ducu ki bere; pe kibicamo.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“Wac bot Aron ki awobene ni, man aye cik me gitum me bal. I kabedo ma kineko iye gitum awangani, en aye kibineko iye gitum me bal inyim Rwot; en gin maleng makato. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Ajwaka ma otyero pi bal en aye bicamone; bicamo i kabedo mo maleng, idyekal me Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Gin ducu ma ogudu ringone bidoko maleng; ka remone okir ikom ginaruka, ibilwoko gin ma remo okir ikomeni i kabedo mo maleng. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Agulu lobo ma kitedo iye kibineko woko; ento ka kitedo i wee mola, ci kibirudu kome, kun kilako ki pii. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Co ducu ma ikin ajwaki gitwero camone; en gin maleng makato. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Ento gitum me bal pe kibicamone teke remone kitero i Kema me Rwate pi timo gin lakwany bal i Kabedo Maleng; kibiwango woko awanga ki mac.”<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />“Man aye cik me gitum me tingo alii. En gin maleng makato. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Ikabedo ma gineko iye gitum awangani en aye gibineko iye gitum me tingo alii, ci gibicoro remone ikom keno tyer rumu twoke ducu. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Kibityero dwolone ducu, moo yibe, dwolo ma oumu jam iye, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />olang aryo ducu ki dwolo ma ikomgi matye ipyere, ki okene matye ikom acwiny ma en bikwanyo woko kacel ki olang aryo. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Ajwaka biwangogi iwi keno tyer obed gin ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot; en aye gitum me tingo alii. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Co ducu ma ikin ajwaki gitwero camone; gibicamo i kabedo mo maleng; en gin maleng makato. <verse eid="LEV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />Gitum me tingo alii rom ki gitum me bal, cikgi tye acel; ajwaka ma otimo kwede gin lakwany bal, en aye biterone. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Dok ajwaka ma otyero gitum awanga pa ngat mo bitero pyen me gitum meno ma en otyeroni. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Gityer me moko kwon ducu ma kitedo i keno, ki mukene ma kitedo ki cupuriya nyo i otako nyonyo, bibedo pa ajwaka ma otyeroni. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Gityer me moko kwon ducu, ma kirubu ki moo, nyo ma nonone, bibedo pa awobe pa Aron ducu; ngat man bitero marom ki lawote.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />Man aye cik me gityer me berbedo ma ngat mo bityero bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Ka en tyero pi miyo pwoc, ci bityero, kacel ki gityer me pwoc, capat ma tobi pe iye ma kirubu ki moo, capat marep ma tobi pe iye ma kireyo moo ikomgi, ki capat ma tobi pe iye me moko kwon mapwote ma kirubu maber ki moo. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />En bityero bene capat me mugati ma kirubu iye tobi kacel ki gitume me gityer me berbedo. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Ikom magi en bityero capat acel ki ikom gityer acel acel obed gityer bot Rwot; meno bibedo pa ajwaka ma ocoro remo me gityer me berbedo. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Ringo me gitume me gityer me berbedo pi miyo pwoc kibicamo inino ma en otyero iye; en pe biweko mo dong nio odiko. <verse eid="LEV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />Ento ka gityere obedo gityer me cobo kwong, nyo gityer mo ma iye opwoyo, kibicamo inino ma en otyero iye, dok mudonge kitwero camo orwone. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Ento ringo mo me gitum mere ma odong inino me adeke myero kiwang awanga ki mac. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Ka kicamo ringo mo me gitum mere me gityer me berbedo inino me adeke, Lubanga pe bigamo ngat ma otyeroni, dok pe kibikwano ni en otyero gin mo, bibedo gin me kwer, ngat ma ocamo, bal bidok iwiye.<verse eid="LEV 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Ringo ma ogudu kom gin mo ma kikwero pe kibicamo; kibiwangone awanga ki mac. Jo ducu ma gulonye gitwero camo ringo, <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />ento ka ngat mo ocamo ringo me gityer me berbedo pa Rwot ma onongo en odoko keni, dano meno pe kibikwano ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Ka ngat mo ogudu kom gin mo ma kikwero, kadi bed gin me kwer ma ikom dano, nyo lee ma kikwero, nyo kit gin moni me kwer ma keni, ka dok camo kwede ringo me gityer me berbedo pa Rwot, dano meno pe kibikwano ikin jo Icrael.”<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, pe myero wucam kit dwolo ducu, kadi me twon, kadi me romo nyo me dyel. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Dwolo geng lee ma oto kene, ki dwolo lee ma nguu omwodo gitwero tic kwede i yo mukene ducu, ento pe gibicamo kadi ki acel. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Dano ducu ma ocamo dwolo lee mo ma kityero kwede gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot, pe kibikwano ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Aca 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">Lev 17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Nwo 12:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref></char></note>Dok pe wubicamo remo gin mo ducu, kadi bed me winyo nyo me lee, kama wubedo iye ducu. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Dano ma ocamo remo gin mo, pe kibikwano ikin jo Icrael.”<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ngat ma otyero gitume me gityer me berbedo myero okel gityer mere ma okwanyo me amiya bot Rwot. Ki ikom gityer mere me berbedo, <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />en bikelo gire ki cinge gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot; en bikelo dwolo ki gok, wek kikwat gok obed gityer me akwata inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Ajwaka biwango dwolo iwi keno tyer, ento gok bibedo pa Aron ki awobene. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Em ma lacuc wubimiyo bot ajwaka obed gityer mere ma oa ki ikom gitum me gityer me berbedo; <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />ngat ma ikin awobe pa Aron ma otyero remo me gityer me berbedo, ki dwolone, bitero em ma lacuc obed wang wate. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Pien gok ma kikwato, ki em ma kityero, atyeko kwanyogi woko ki bot jo Icrael ki ikom gityergi me berbedo, amiyogi bot ajwaka Aron ki bot awobene, ma myero jo Icrael gumi botgi pi kare ducu ma bibino anyim. <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Man aye wang wat pa Aron ki pa awobene ma a ki ikom gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot, mayam kikwero obed megi inino mayam kikelogi wek guti bot Rwot macalo ajwaki. <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Rwot yam ociko ni jo Icrael gubed kamiyo botgi ikare mayam ki wirogi ki moo; man bibedo wang watgi matwal nio wa ikare pa likwayogi ducu.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Man aye cik me gitum awanga, me gityer me moko kwon, me gitum me bal, me gitum me tingo alii, me keto ajwaka i dog tic, ki me gitum me gityer me berbedo, <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses iwi got Cinai inino mayam ociko iye jo Icrael ni gukel gityer megi bot Rwot, i tim Cinai.”<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kwero Aron ki awobene pi tic maleng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:1-37">Nia 29:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Ter Aron kacel ki awobene, ki bongi arukagi, ki moo wir, ki twon me gitum me bal, ki nyogi romi aryo, ki aduku me Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye; <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />ci icok lwak ducu kacel idogola Kema me Rwate.” <verse eid="LEV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Moses otiyo kit macalo Rwot ocike; ci lwak gucoke idogola Kema me Rwate.<verse eid="LEV 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Moses owaco bot lwak ni, “Man aye gin ma Rwot ociko ni kiti.” <verse eid="LEV 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Ci Moses okelo Aron ki awobene ci olwokogi ki pii. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />En oruku Aron ki kanyi, otweyo pyere ki kitambara latwe pyer, ka dok oruke ki jor, oketo epod ikome, otweyo pyere ki ceme me epod ma kicweyo ki diro, otweyo, orido kwede ikome. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Oketo kicaa kor i kore, ka dok oketo Urim ki Tumim i kicaa kor. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Ka dok odwalo kitambara me adwala iwiye, ka otweyo akwaya jabu ikom kitambara me wic inyime, me bedo lalukana maleng macalo yam Rwot ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Moses okwanyo moo wir ci owiro ki kema ki jami ducu matye iye, olonyogi kitmeno bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />En okiro moo ikom keno tyer tyen abiro, ci owiro keno tyer ki jami tice ducu ki moo, kacel ki otako lwok ki tedi tere, pi kwerogi. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Dok oonyo moo iwi Aron, ci owire kwede pi kwerone. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Moses dok okelo awobe pa Aron, ci orukugi ki kanyi, otweyo pyergi ki kitambara latwe pyer, ka otweyo kitambara adwala me wic iwigi, kit macalo Rwot yam ociko Moses.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Lacen Moses okelo twon me gitum me bal, ci Aron ki awobene guketo cinggi iwi twon me gitum me bal. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Moses oneko twon, ogwelo remone ci oreyo ikom ten keno angwen me keno tyer ki lwet cinge orumu kome ducu, olonyo kwede keno tyer, okwero pi kwanyo bal ki ikome. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Dok Moses okwanyo dwolo ducu ma ikom jam iye, ki okene ma ikom acwiny, ki olang aryo ki dwologi ducu, ci owangogi iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Ento ringo twonu ki pyene ki wee iye owango awanga ki mac woko wa inge gony, kit macalo yam Rwot ociko.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Lacen inge man, en okelo nyok romo me gitum awanga, ci Aron ki awobene oketo cinggi iwiye. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Moses oneko, ci ocoro remone ikom keno tyer kun rumu kome ducu. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Ka dong kingido ringo nyok romo woko, Moses owango wiye ki ringo ma kingidoni ki dwolone. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Jam iye ki tyene ducu kilwoko ki pii, lacen Moses owango ringo nyok romo woko ducu ki bere iwi keno tyer obedo gitum awanga, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. En gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot, macalo yam Rwot ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Lacen Moses okelo nyok romo mukene, en nyok romo me keto dano i dog tic, ci Aron ki awobene guketo cinggi iwi nyok romo. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Moses oneko, ogwelo remone ci oreyo i ogwilo it Aron ma lacuc, ki ikom twon nyig cinge ma lacuc, ki ikom twon nyig tyene ma lacuc. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Kikelo awobe pa Aron ci Moses oreyo remo i ogwilo itgi ma lacuc, ki ikom twon nyig cinggi ma lacuc, ki ikom twon nyig tyen gi ma lacuc; ka Moses ocoro remo ikom keno tyer kun rumu kome ducu. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Lacen okwanyo dwolo, ki moo yibe, ki dwolo ducu ma ikom jam iye, ki okene matye ikom acwiny, ki olang aryo ducu kacel ki dwologi, ki em ma lacuc. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Ka okwanyo capat acel ma tobi pe iye ki i aduku me Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye matye inyim Rwot, ki capat acel me mugati ma kirubu ki moo, ki capat acel marep, oketogi iwi dwolo ki iwi em ma lacuc. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />En oketo magi ducu i dye cing Aron ki i dye cing awobene, ci okwatogi me bedo gityer me akwata inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Lacen Moses okwanyogi ki i cinggi, owangogi woko iwi keno tyer kacel ki gitum awanga, obed gityer me keto dano i dog tic, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. En gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Moses okwanyo gok, okwato me bedo gityer akwata inyim Rwot; en aye obedo wang wat pa Moses ma oa ki ikom nyok romo me ketogi i dog tic, kit macalo yam Rwot ociko.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Moses okwanyo moo wir ki remo manok ma iwi keno tyer, ci okiro ikom Aron ki ikom bongi arukane, ki ikom awobene ki bongi arukagi; kitmeno okwero Aron ki bongi arukane, ki awobene ki bongi arukagi, gudoko maleng.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Moses owaco bot Aron ki awobene ni, “Wuted ringo idogola Kema me Rwate, wucam ki kunu, kacel ki mugati matye i aduku me gityer me ketowu i dog tic, macalo yam aciko kun awaco ni, ‘Aron ki awobene aye gibicamone.’ <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Ringo ki mugati ma odong myero wuwang awanga ki mac. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Pe wubikato woko ki idogola Kema me Rwate pi nino abiro, nio ka kare me ketowu i dog tic ocobe kakare, pien ketowu i dog tic bitero nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Gin ma kibedo katiyone tin, yam Rwot ociko ni kitim me lakwany bal ki ikomwu. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Wun wubibedo idogola Kema me Rwate pi nino abiro, kun wulubu gin ma Rwot ociko, wek pe wuto; pien kicika kitmeno.” <verse eid="LEV 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Aron ki awobene gutiyo gin ducu ma Rwot yam ociko ki i dog Moses.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Aron otyero gitum mapatpat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Inino me aborone Moses olwongo Aron ki awobene ki ludongo pa jo Icrael, <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />ci owaco bot Aron ni, “Kwany wod twon, pi gitum me bal, ki nyok romo pi gitum awanga, ma pe komgi kimwonyo ducu, wek ityergi inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Dok iwac bot jo Icrael ni, ‘Wukwany nyok dyel pi gitum me bal, wod twon ki latin romo ma ditogi tye mwaka acel acel ma pe komgi kimwonyo, pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />Ka dok wukwany twon ki nyok romo pi gityer me berbedo, me atuma inyim Rwot, ki gityer me moko kwon ma kirubu ki moo; pien Rwot binen botwu tin.’” <verse eid="LEV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Ci gukelo gin ma Moses ociko inyim Kema me Rwate; ci lwak ducu gunyiko cok, gucung inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Moses owaco ni, “Man aye gin ma Rwot ociko ni wutii, ci deyo pa Rwot binen botwu.” <verse eid="LEV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:27">Ibru 7:27</ref></char></note>Moses dok owaco bot Aron ni, “Nyik cok ki keno tyer, wek ityer gitum me bali ki gitum awangani, ci i tim gin lakwany bal ki ikomi ki ikom lwak bene. Dok ikel gityer pa lwak wek i tim gin lakwany bal ki ikomgi macalo yam Rwot ociko.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Aron ocako nyiko cok ki keno tyer ci oneko wod twon me gitum me bal ma onongo tye pire kikome. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Ka awobe pa Aron gumiyo remo bote, en olutu lwet cinge i remo ci oreyo kom ten keno angwen me keno tyer, ka oonyo remo ite tedi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Ento dwolo ki olang aryo ki okene matye ikom acwiny ma okwanyo ki ikom gitum me bal en owango woko iwi keno tyer, kit macalo yam Rwot ociko ki Moses. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Ringone ki pyene en owango awanga ki mac woko inge gony.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Ka oneko lee me gitum awanga, ci awobe pa Aron gumiyo remo bote, ci en ocoro ikom keno tyer kun rumu kome ducu. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Ka dok gumiyo gitum awanga bote ikit ma kingido kwede, kacel ki wic ci en owangogi iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />En olwoko jam iye ki tyene ducu, ci owangogi iwi keno tyer kacel ki gitum awanga.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Ka man otum, ci en otyero gityer pa lwak. Okwanyo dyel me gitum me bal ma onongo tye pi lwak, ci oneko, otyero pi bal, macalo gitum me bal mukwongo. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Ka dok omiyo gitum awanga, otyero kun lubu cik. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Ka otyero gityer me moko kwon, ci ojobo pong cinge, owango iwi keno tyer, omedo ikom gitum awanga me odiko.<verse eid="LEV 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 3:1-11">Lev 3:1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci dok en oneko twon ki nyok romo bene, en gitum me gityer me berbedo ma onongo tye pi lwak. Awobe pa Aron gumiyo remo bote, ci en ocoro ikom keno tyer kun rumu kome ducu. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Ka dok gumiye dwolo me twon ki me nyok romo, ki moo yibe, dwolo ma oumu jam iye, olang aryo, ki okene ki ma ikom acwiny. <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />Guketo dwolo iwi gok, ci owango dwolo iwi keno tyer, <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />ento gok ki em ma lacuc Aron okwato me bedo gityer akwata inyim Rwot, macalo Moses ociko.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:22-26">Wel 6:22-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka dong Aron oilo cinge malo tung bot lwak, ci olego gum ikomgi, ci olor piny nia ki katyero gitum me bal ki gitum awanga ki gityer me berbedo ducu. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Lacen Moses ki Aron gudonyo i Kema me Rwate; ka gukati woko, ci gulego gum ikom lwak, ci deyo pa Rwot onen bot lwak ducu. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Ka mac oa ki inyim Rwot obino owango gitum awanga ki dwolo ma iwi keno tyer, otyeko woko ducu. Ma lwak ducu guneno, gudange ki woo, gupoto piny aryeba ic.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bal pa Nadab ki Abiu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Nadab ki Abiu, awobe pa Aron, ngat acel acel okwanyo atabo weene me wango odok ma ngwece kur, guketo iye mac, ka guketo iye odok ma ngwece kur, ci gutyero mac mapat ma Rwot pe ociko ni kiwang inyime. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Ci mac oa ki inyim Rwot, owangogi, ci guto woko ki inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Ka Moses owaco bot Aron ni, “Man aye gin ma Rwot owaco ni, ‘Abinyute kekena ikin jo ma gitye cok kweda ni aleng, dok gibiketo deyo ikoma inyim lwak ducu.’” Ento Aron oling gire mot.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Ka Moses olwongo Micael ki Elijapan, awobe pa Ujiel omin won Aron, ci owaco botgi ni, “Wunyik cok, wek wuting omegiwu ki inyim Kabedo Maleng, wutergi woko inge gony.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Ci gunyiko cok, gutingo komgi ki kanyigi, guterogi woko inge gony, kit macalo Moses owaco.<verse eid="LEV 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Ci Moses owaco bot Aron ki bot Eleajar ki Itamar ma gin awobene ni. “Pe wukwer jwero yer wiwu, dok pe wuyec ginarukawu, wek pe wuto, dok wek kiniga pe opot ikom lwak ducu. Ento utmegiwu, jo ducu me ot pa jo Icrael, gitwero kok pi to ma mac pa Rwot okelo. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Pe wukat woko ki idogola Kema me Rwate, wek pe wuto, pien moo wir pa Rwot tye ikomwu.” Ci gutiyo kit ma Moses owaco botgi.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako tic pa ajwaki ki wang watgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Rwot oloko ki Aron kun waco ni, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Pe imat kongo bwino nyo gin ma mero dano, in kacel ki awobeni, ka wucito i Kema me Rwate, wek pe wuto; meno bibedo cik matwal nio wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Myero wupok kin jami maleng ki jami ma pe leng, ki kin gin ma keni ki gin ma pe keni. <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />Dok wubipwonyo jo Icrael ki cik ducu ma Rwot ocikogi kwede ki i dog Moses.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 6:14-18">Lev 6:14-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Moses owaco bot Aron, ki bot Eleajar ki Itamar, awobene mayam gudong ni, “Wukwany gityer me moko kwon ma odong ki ikom gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot, ci wucam ma tobi pe iye, inget keno tyer, pien en gin maleng makato. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Myero wucam ki i kabedo mo maleng, pien en aye wang watti ki wang wat pa awobeni ma a ki ikom gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot; pien yam kicika kitmeno. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:30-34">Lev 7:30-34</ref></char></note>Ento gok ma kikwato ki em ma kityero wubicamo i kabedo mo ma kilonyo maleng, in ki awobeni ki anyirani kacel, pien kimiyogi gubed wang watti ki wang wat pa awobeni, ma a ki ikom gityer me berbedo pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Gin bikelo em ki gok ma ki ilo malo me akwatani kacel ki gityer ma kiwango ki mac ma en aye dwolo, wek kikwat inyim Rwot me gityer akwata. Magi bibedo meri ki pa lutinoni matwal, kit macalo yam Rwot ociko.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Ka Moses openyo pi dyel me gitum me bal, ci onongo ni dong kiwango woko. Akemo omake ikom Eleajar ki Itamar, awobe pa Aron ma gudongi, ci owaco ni, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:24-26">Lev 6:24-26</ref></char></note>“Pingo pe wucamo gitum me bal ki i Kabedo Maleng? Pien meno obedo gin maleng atika ma Lubanga omiyo ki wun wek wuting bal pa lwak, wek odok lakwany bal pirgi inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Kit macalo remo me gityer meno pe gukelo i tyelo i Kabedo Maleng, onongo omyero bene wucam gityer meno ki kunu, kit mayam aciko.” <verse eid="LEV 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Aron ogamo dog Moses ni, “Nen, tin gutyero gitum me bal ki gitum awangagi inyim Rwot, ci gin macalo man dong opoto ikoma. Ka kono abedo kacamo gitum me bal tin, kono obedo myero iwang Rwot?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Ka Moses owinyo lok meno, ci cwinye okwe.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lee ma kicamo ki ma kikwero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 14:3-21">Nwo 14:3-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />“Wuwac bot jo Icrael ni, man aye gin makwo ma wutwero camo ki ikin lee ducu matye iwi lobo. <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />Lee ducu ma obong tyen gi akara, ma kin tyen gi opoke, ma nyamo omen, ma ikin lee ducu wutwero camone. <verse eid="LEV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Ento lee ma nyamo omen nyo ma obong tyen gi akara ma pe wubicamo gin ene: Kinaga kadi en nyamo omen, ento obong tyene pe akara; pimeno bedo keni botwu, wubikwerone. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Ki oduka nyamo omen, ento obong tyene pe akara; pimeno bedo keni botwu, wubikwerone. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Ki apwoyo bene kadi en nyamo omen, ento obong tyene pe akara; pimeno bedo keni botwu, wubikwerone. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Ki opego, kadi obong tyene akara, kin tyene opoke, ento pe nyamo omen; pimeno bedo keni botwu, wubikwero. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Pe wucam ringogi, pe wugud wa komgi ma oto bene; gin bedo keni botwu, wubikwerogi.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />Magi aye wutwero camogi ki ikin gin ducu ma bedo i pii. Gin ducu ma bedo i pii matye ki kinga ngegi ki pok komgi, ma i nam ki ma i kulu ducu, wutwero camogi. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Ento gin ducu matye i nam ki i kulu ducu ma pe ki kinga ngegi ki pok komgi ikin gin ma core limuk i pii ki ikin gin makwo ma bedo i pii, bedo gin me kwer botwu. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Gibibedo me kwer botwu; pe wubicamo ringogi, dok komgi ma otone bene bedo me kwer botwu. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Gin ducu ma i pii ma pe ki kinga ngegi ki pok komgi bedo me kwer botwu.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />Magi aye gin ma bibedo me kwer botwu ki ikin winyo; pe wubicamogi, gin gibedo me kwer: ocur, acut, koga, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />okwata, ocecu ki kit kwayigi ducu; <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />agak ki kit kwayigi ducu; <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />udu, tepe, wewet, olwit ki kit kwayigi ducu; <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />tula, alwinya, adyeladyel, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />lagweno kulu, kikung, ki ocur madito, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />acebe, ogoro ki kit kwayigi ducu; ki putput, ki olik.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />Kwidi ducu matye ki bwomgi, ma giwoto ki tyen gi angwen bedo me kwer botwu. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Ento ikin kwidi matye ki bwomgi, ma giwoto ki tyen gi angwen, wutwero camo gin matye ki tyen gi mabocone ma gipye kwede iwi lobo. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Wutwero camo magi ikin gi: bonyo ki kit kwayigi ducu; lacene ki kit kwayigi ducu, labar ki kit kwayigi ducu; ki otwongo ki kit kwayigi ducu. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Ento kwidi mukene ducu ma gitye ki bwomgi, ma gitye ki tyen gi angwen, gibedo me kwer botwu.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />Magi gin ma bimiyo wudoko keni; ngat ma ogudu kom ma otone bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Ngat ma otingo dul komgi mo ma otoni bilwoko bongine ci bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Lee ducu ma obong tyene akara, ento kin tyene pe opoke, nyo ma pe nyamo omen, bedo keni botwu; ngat ma ogudu komgi bibedo keni. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Ki lee ducu ma woto ki opany tyen gi, ikin lee ducu ma giwoto ki tyen gi angwen, bedo keni botwu. Ngat ma ogudu kom ma otone bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Dok ngat ma otingo kom ma otone bilwoko bongine ci bibedo keni nio wa otyeno; gin bedo keni botwu, wubikwerogi.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />Man aye gin ma bedo keni botwu ki ikin gin ma nya ma core limuk iwi lobo: oculi, oyo adeng, lagwe lakaka ki kit kwayigi ducu, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />laromo ot, ngec, lagwe kweyo, ki langogo. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Magi aye gin ma keni botwu ki ikin gin ducu ma gicore limuk; ngat ma ogudu komgi ka guto bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Ka mo ikin magi madong otone opoto ikom jami moni, jaminu bibedo keni, kadi wee, nyo bongo aruka, nyo laa, nyo kicaa, jami mo keken ma kitiyo kwede pi kit tic moni; myero kiket i pii, ci bibedo keni nio wa otyeno, ka dong bibedo ma olony. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Dok ka mo ikin gi opoto i agulu, nyo atabo nyo kit gin mo macalo meno ma kicweyo ki lobo, gin ducu matye iye bibedo keni, agulu nyo atabo wubineko woko. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Gin acama mo ma kicamo ce ki onyo iye pii ma i agulu meno, bibedo keni; ki gin amata ma kimato ki i agulu nyo atabo meno bibedo keni. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Jami ducu ma dul komgi mo ma otoni opoto ikome bibedo keni, kadi keno nyo tuk keno kibimuku woko; gin gudoko keni, ci gibibedo keni botwu. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Kadi bed kumeno, ento ka kom gin magi mutoni opoto iwang it nyo got ma kipayo me jolo pii bibedo ma olony; ento gin ducu ma bigudo kom gin ma otoni bibedo keni. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Ka dul komgi ma otoni opoto ikom kodi mo me acoya, ma kibicoyo, kodinu bibedo ma olony; <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />ento ka onongo kionyo pii ikom kodinu, ce dul kom gin mo ma otoni opoto ikome, ci bedo keni botwu.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />Ka lee mo ma kicamo oto woko, ngat ma ogudu geng meno bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Ngat ma ocamo geng meno bilwoko bongine ci bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. Dok ngat ma otingo geng meno bilwoko bongine, ci bibedo keni nio wa otyeno.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />Gin ducu ma nya ma core limuk iwi lobo gin aye gin me kwer; pe wubicamogi. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Gin ducu ma woto kun ywane ki iye, ki gin ducu ma woto ki tyen gi angwen, nyo matye ki lwak tyen gi mapol, gin ducu ma nya ma core limuk iwi lobo pe wubicamogi, pien gin aye gin me kwer. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Pe wuloke wudok gin me kwer pi gin moni ma nya ma core limuk; dok pe wubale wudok keni pirgi. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:16">1 Pet 1:16</ref></char></note>Pien An a Rwot Lubangawu; pimeno wulonye kekenwu wubed maleng, pien an aleng. Pe wubale wudok keni pi gin mo ma core limuk ma lak iwi lobo. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Pien an aye a Rwot ma akwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt, wek abed Lubangawu; ma omiyo wubed jo maleng, pien an aleng.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />Man aye cik ma otiko lee ki winyo ki gin makwo ducu ma kwang i pii, ki gin ducu ma core limuk iwi lobo, <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />wek dano gupok kin gin ma keni ki gin ma olony, ki kin gin makwo ma kitwero camo ki gin makwo ma pe kitwero camo.”<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lonyo dako ma onywal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ka dako ogamo ic ce onywalo latin laco, en bibedo keni pi nino abiro; bibedo keni macalo ikare me kwerne. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Aca 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luk 2:21</ref></char></note>Inino me aborone en aye kibiliro iye del kom nyim latin me co. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Dako dok bimede ki kwere pi nino pyere adek wiye adek wek olonye nia i remone; en pe bigudo gin mo maleng, pe bicito i Ot pa Lubanga, nio ka kare me lonyene otum. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Ento ka onywalo latin nyako, en bibedo keni macalo ikare me kwerne pi cabit aryo. Ka dok bimede pi nino pyere abicel wiye abicel wek olonye nia i kwer mere.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />Ka kare me lonyene otum, ka nyo pi awobi nyo pi nyako, dako bikelo latin romo ma dite romo mwaka acel bot ajwaka idogola Kema me Rwate pi gitum awanga, ki latin akuri, nyo amam, pi gitum me bal. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Ajwaka bityero inyim Rwot, ci bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom dako, ci dong bilonye ki i remone ma ocwer. Man aye cik ma mako dako ma onywalo latin laco nyo ma nyako. <verse eid="LEV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:24">Luk 2:24</ref></char></note>Ka nongo latin romo oloye, en bitero amam aryo, nyo lutino akuri aryo, acel pi gitum awanga, acel pi gitum me bal: ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome, ci dong bedo ma olonye.”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako two mapatpat me del kom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Ka dano mo del kome okwot, nyo orugu, nyo orobo, ce odoko two me dobo i del kome, ci omyero kikele bot ajwaka Aron, nyo bot ngat acel ikin awobene ma gin aye ajwaki. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Ajwaka bingiyo two ma orugu i del komeni; ce yer ma i del kome ma oruguni odoko lwar matar, dok ka twone onen ni ogole matut ma okato del kome, ci meno two dobo, ka ajwaka dong ongiyo kome, ci bimoko ni, kome kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Ento ka del komeni orugu matar kun pe nen ni ogole matut okato del, dok ka yer matye iye bene pe oloke odoko lwar, ci ajwaka bigwoko dano ma latwoni iot kakene pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Inino me abirone ajwaka dok bingiyo kome, ci ka onen bote ni twone dong pe onya omede i del kome, ci ajwaka bimede ki gwoko danoni iot pi nino abiro mukene. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Inino me abirone ajwaka dok bingiyo kome, ci ka two ma onongo orugu komeni dong ojwik woko, dok twone pe onya omede i del kome, ci ajwaka bimoko ni kome pe kikeni, ento onongo orugu aruga. Danoni myero olwok bongine ci bibedo ma olony. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Ento kace kome ma oruguni onya omede i del kome, madong onongo onyute kene bot ajwaka pi lonyene, ci en myero dok obin inyim ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Ajwaka bingiyo, ci ka onongo ni kome ma oruguni dong onya omede i del kome, ci ajwaka bimoko ni kome kikeni, meno two dobo.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />Ka two dobo omako dano mo ci kibikele bot ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Ajwaka bingiyo, ci ka del kome mo tye ma okwot ma okwor matar, ma otyeko loko yer odoko lwar, dok bur odet manyen kama okwoti, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />meno nongo two dobo mayam orii i del kome. Ajwaka bimoko ni kome kikeni; pe bigwoke iot kakene, pien kome kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />Ka two ocore i del kome, ma oromo del kom danoni woko nia iwiye nio wa ityene, ma ajwaka twero neno ducu, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />ci ajwaka bingiyo. Ka kome ducu odoko tar, ci ajwaka bimoko ni two meno dong pe ikome; pien nongo kome ducu okwor matar, kome pe kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Ento ka bur odet manen ikome, ci kome bibedo kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Ajwaka bingiyo bur mudet manyeni, ci bimoko ni kome kikeni; bur ma odet manyeni bedo keni, ma nyutuni meno two dobo. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Ento kace bur ma odet manyeni dok oloke odoko matar, ci bidwogo bot ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Ajwaka bingiyo kome, ci ka two odoko matar, ajwaka bimoko ni latwo kome pe kikeni; en dong ocang woko.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />Ka odeke okwot i del kom ngat mo ce oboone ci ocang woko, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />ka lacen dok ojer okwot iwang odekenu ma okwor matar, nyo orobo matar kun bedo makwarkwar, ci myero kinyut bot ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Ajwaka bingiyo, ci ka onen ni ogole matut okato del kom, ki yer bene odoko lwar, ci ajwaka bimoko ni kome kikeni: meno two dobo ma otyer iwang odeke. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Ento ka ajwaka ongiyo, ci yer matye iye pe lwar, dok pe ogole matut ma okato del kom, ento dong ojwik woko, ci ajwaka bigwoko danoni iot kakene pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Ka onya omede i del kome, ci ajwaka bimoko ni kome kikeni, pien meno en latwo. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Ento kace wange ma oruguni ogik i kabedo acel ma pe onya omede, meno poyo wang odeke keken, ci ajwaka bimoko ni kome pe kikeni.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />Nyo ka mac owango dano mo ci opwaco del kome, ce bur odet manyen iwang kama opwaci, ci orugu matar kun obedo makwarkwar, nyo okwor matar, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />ci ajwaka bingiyo. Ka yer ma i wange odoko lwar, dok onen ni ogole matut ma okato del kom, ci nongo meno two dobo aye opoto iwang kama opwaci. Ajwaka bimoko ni kome kikeni; meno two dobo. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Ento ka ajwaka ongiyo, ci yer ma i wange ma oroboni pe lwar, dok pe ogole matut ma okato del kom, ento ojwik woko, ci ajwaka bigwoko danoni iot kakene pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Inino me abirone ajwaka bingiyo; ka tye ka nya mede i del kome, ci ajwaka bimoko ni kome kikeni; meno two dobo. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Ento kace wange ma oruguni ogik i kabedo acel ma pe onya omede i del kome, ento ojwik woko, ci meno nongo gin ma okwot akwota iwang kama opwac keken; ajwaka bimoko ni kome pe kikeni, pien meno wang poyo kama mac owango.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />Ka laco mo nyo dako mo two orugu iwiye nyo itike, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />ci ajwaka bingiyo twone. Ka onen ni ogole matut okato del kom, dok yer matye iye odoko ocwakocwak, dok ojwer woko, ci ajwaka bimoko ni kome kikeni; meno two akukuc, en dobo me wic nyo me tik. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Ka ajwaka ongiyo two akukuc, ce onen ni ogole matut okato del kom, kun yer macol pe iye, ci ajwaka bigwoko dano meno matye ki two akukuc iot kakene pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Inino me abirone ajwaka bingiyo twone; ka akukuc pe onya omede, dok pe tye iye yer ma obedo ocwakocwak, dok akukuc pe onen ni ogole matut okato del kom, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />ci danoni bilyelo wiye woko, ento pe bilyelo kama obedo akukuci. Ajwaka bimedo gwoko dano meno iot kakene pi nino abiro mukene. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Inino me abirone ajwaka bingiyo akukuc; ka akukuc pe onya omede i del kome, kun pe nen ni ogole matut okato del kom, ci ajwaka bimoko ni kome pe kikeni. En bilwoko bongine ci bibedo ma olony. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Ento kace akukuc onya omede i del kome inge lonyene, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />ci ajwaka bingiyo kome. Ka akukuc onya omede i del kome, ajwaka pe dok oyeny yer ma obedo ocwakocwak; te lokeni kome kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Ento ka onen bote ni akukuc dong ogiko nya, dok yer macol tye olot iye, nongo akukuc dong ocang woko, en dong ocang woko; ajwaka bimoko ni kome pe kikeni.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />Ka laco mo nyo dako mo ikinwu del kome otabutabu ma okwor matar, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />ajwaka bingiyo. Ka del kome orobo, ce kome oonyo ma pe okwor matar tutwal, nongo del kome oonyo odugi aduga keken; kome pe kikeni.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />Ka yer wi laco mo otal woko, en bedo lawiye otal, ento kome pe kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Dok ka laco mo yer olwer woko ki itur nyime nyo iteng wiye, en bedo ma wiye otal itur nyime, ento kome pe kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Ento ka two mo orugu matar kun obedo makwarkwar iwiye nyo itur nyime ma otali, meno two dobo aye ma ocore iwiye ma otali, nyo itur nyime ma otali. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Ajwaka bingiyo kome: ci ka two ma okwoto wiye nyo tur nyime ma otali obedo matar makwarkwar, kun nen calo two dobo ma i del kom dano, nongo <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />en dano ma ladobo, dok kome kikeni. Ajwaka myero otuc ni kome kikeni; twone tye iwiye.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />Ngat matye ki two dobo myero oruk bongi ma ogenyogeny, dok biweko yer wiye ma okeko ma ojany ata lijayi, ci umu del doge mamalo woko, ka bidange ni, ‘Koma kikeni! Koma kikeni!’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />En bibedo keni pi kare ducu me twone; pien kome kikeni. Dok en bibedo i kabedone kene, woko inge gony.<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cik ma mako bongo ma opuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />Kace gin mo ma opuru onen ikom ginaruka mo kadi bed me bongo yer romo nyo bongo camanini, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />nyo ikom uci bongo ma kicweyo atir nyo ma ocung arii, nyo ikom laa, nyo ikom gin mo ma kiyubu ki laa, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />ka kama opuruni nen tworotworo nyo makwarkwar ikom bongo, ikom uci bongo ma kicweyo atir nyo ma ocung arii, nyo ikom gin mo ma kiyubu ki laa, meno gin ma opuru, omyero kinyut bot ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Ajwaka bingiyo gin meno ma opuruni, ci bigwoko jami ma opuruni kakene pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Inino me abirone en bingiyo gin ma opuruni. Ka gin ma opuruni onya omede i ginaruka, ikom uci bongo ma ocung atir nyo ma obutu arii, nyo ikom laa, kadi bed laa ma kiyubu pi kit tic mo, meno aye gin ma tobo bongo; meno bedo keni, pe dok kibirukune. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Ajwaka biwango ginaruka meno, kadi bed gin ma opuruni tye ikom uci ma atire nyo ma ariine, ibongo yer romo nyo ibongo camanini, nyo ikom gin mo ma kitiyo ki laa, pien meno gin ma tobo jami; pimeno kibiwango woko awanga ki mac.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />Ka ajwaka ongiyo, ce pe onya omede i ginaruka, ikom uci ma atire nyo ikom uci ma ariine, nyo ikom gin mo ma kitiyo ki laa, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />ci ajwaka biciko ni kilwok jami ma gin ma opuru tye iyeni, ci bimede ki gwokone pi nino abiro mukene. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Dok ajwaka bingiyo jami ma opuruni inge lwokogi. Ka rangi pe oloke kama opuruni, kadi bed gin ma opuruni pe onya omede, jaminu keni; wubiwango woko awanga ki mac, kadi bed gin ma opuruni otobo tung ngeye nyo tung iye.<verse eid="LEV 13:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Ento kace ajwaka ongiyo, ci gin ma opuruni pe nen tutwal inge lwokone, en biyeco dul meno woko ki ikom ginaruka, nyo ki ikom laa, ki ikom ucine ma atire nyo ikom uci ma ariine. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Lacen ka gin ma opuruni dok onen ikom ginarukanu, nyo ikom ucine ma atire nyo ma ariine, nyo ikom gin mo ma kitiyo ki laa, nongo tye ka nya mede; ka gin ma opuruni tye iye ci wubiwango woko awanga ki mac. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Ento ginaruka, kadi bed uci ma atire nyo ma ariine, nyo gin mo ma kitiyo ki laa, ma gin ma opuruni oa ikome ka ilwoko, myero kilwok tyen me aryo, ci kibirukune odoco.<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Man aye cik ma mako gin ma puru ikom ginaruka me bongo yer romo nyo bongo camanini, ikom uci bongo ma atire nyo uci bongo ma ariine, nyo ikom gin mo ma kitiyo ki laa, pi moko ka kiromo ruku bongo meno onyo pe.”<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Lonye inge twoyo two delkom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mat 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:44">Mar 1:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:14">Luk 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:14">17:14</ref></char></note>“Man aye bibedo kwer ma mako ngat ma twoyo two delkom inino me lonyene. Kibikele bot ajwaka, <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />ci ajwaka bikato woko inge gony ka ngiyo kome. Ka two delkom dong ocang woko ki ikome, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />ci ajwaka biciko ni kikel winyo makwo aryo ma kitwero camogi, ki yat cedar, uci makwar, ki anyero, pi dano ma ki mito kwero wek olonyeni. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Ajwaka biciko ni kitwom pii ma mol, wek kiony i otako, ci kinek winyo acel ki malo iwi pii meno. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />En bimako winyo makwo kacel ki yat cedar ki uci makwari ki anyero, ci bilutugi kacel ki winyo makwo i remo winyo ma onongo kineko ki malo iwi pii mamoli. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Ajwaka bikiro remo ikom dano ma kikwero kwer me lonyo two delkom ki ikomeni tyen abiro; lacen bimoko ni en dong olonye gire woko, ci biweko winyo makwoni tuk dok i tim. <verse eid="LEV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />Ci dano man ma kikwero pi lonyeni bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilyelo yer kome ducu, ka bilwoko kome ki pii, ci bibedo ma olonye. I nge meno en dong bidok cen igony, ento bibutu woko inge kemane pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Inino me abirone bilyelo yer wiye ducu, dok bilyelo yer tike ki yer pyen wange ki yer kome ducu. Ka dok bilwoko bongine, bilwoko kome ki pii, ci dong bibedo ma olonye.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />Dok inino me aborone en bitero lutino nyogi romi aryo ma komgi pe kimwonyo, ki bwong romo madite romo mwaka acel, ki gityer me moko kwon maromo agwata adek, moko mapwote ma kirubu ki moo, ki moo maromo cupa acel. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Ajwaka ma okwereni bitero dano man ma kilonyoni, cibo kacel ki jamine inyim Rwot idogola Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="LEV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />Ajwaka bikwanyo nyok romo acel, bityero me gitum pi alii, kacel ki cupa moo acelu, ci kwatogi me bedo gityer akwata inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />En bineko latin romonu i kabedo ma kineko iye gitum pi bal ki gitum awanga, i kabedo maleng, pien gitum me alii rom ki gitum me bal, ducu bedo pa ajwaka; en gin maleng makato. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Ajwaka bigwelo remo me gitum me alii, bireyo i ogwilo it dano ma kilonyoni, ma lacuc, ki ikom twon nyig cinge ma lacuc, ki itwon nyig tyene ma lacuc. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Ka ajwaka bikwanyo moo maromo cupa aceli, bitono manok i dye cinge ma lacam, <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />ka lutu lwet cinge ma lacuc i moo ma i dye cinge ma lacami, ci kiro moo ki nyig cinge tyen abiro inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Ajwaka bireyo moo ma odong i cingeni i ogwilo it dano ma kilonyoni ma lacuc, ki itwon nyig cinge ma lacuc, ki itwon nyig tyene ma lacuc, ikom remo me gitum me alii. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Moo ma odong i cing ajwaka en bidunyo iwi dano ma kilonyoni, ka ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />Ajwaka bityero gitum me bal me kwanyo bal ki ikom dano ma ki mito lonyo keni ma ikomeni. Lacen en bineko gitum awanga, <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />ci ajwaka bityero gitum awanga kacel ki gitum me moko kwon iwi keno tyer. Kitmeno ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome, ci dong bilonye.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />Ento ka en lacan ma nongo jami meno ducu oloye, ci en bikwanyo latin nyok romo acel obed gitum me alii me akwata, pi kwanyo bal ki ikome, ki agwata moko kwon acel me moko mapwote ma kirubu ki moo pi gityer me moko kwon, ki moo maromo cupa acel; <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />dok amam aryo nyo lutino akuri aryo, macalo en romo nongone; acel bibedo gitum me bal, acel bibedo gitum awanga. <verse eid="LEV 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />Inino me aborone en bikelo bot ajwaka pi lonyene idogola Kema me Rwate inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Ajwaka bikwanyo latin romo me gitum me alii, kacel ki moo maromo cupa aceli, ci bikwatogi me bedo gityer akwata inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Ka dok bineko latin romo me gitum me alii; ci ajwaka bigwelo remo me gitum man, bireyone i ogwilo it dano ma kilonyoni ma lacuc, ki itwon nyig cinge ma lacuc, ki itwon nyig tyene ma lacuc. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Ka ajwaka bitono moo manok i dye cinge ma lacam, <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />ci bikiro moo ma i dye cinge ma lacami tyen abiro inyim Rwot ki nyig cinge ma lacuc. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Ka ajwaka bireyo moo ma i cinge ma lacuc i ogwilo it dano ma kilonyoni, ki itwon nyig cinge ma lacuc, ki itwon nyig tyene ma lacuc, kama kireyo iye remo me gitum me alii. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Moo ma odong i cing ajwaka bidunyo iwi dano ma kilonyoni, me lakok dano ki ibal ki ikome inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Ikom amam nyo lutino akuri ma en romo nongone, <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />en bityero acel pi gitum me bal, ki acel pi gitum awanga, kacel ki gityer me moko kwon; ci ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom dano ma kilonyoni, inyim Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Man aye cik ma mako dano matye ki two delkom, ma pe romo nongo gityer ducu ma kiciko pi lonyene.”<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ot ma puru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />“Ka dong wuo i lobo Kanaan ma abimiyowu me bedo mewu, kace aketo gin mamiyo ot puru i lobo ma abimiyowuni, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />ci won ot bicito tito bot ajwaka kun waco ni, ‘I oda nen calo tye iye lakit gin moni mamiyo ot puruni.’ <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Ajwaka biciko ni kicok jami, kikel woko wek ot odong ma iye nono ma nongo peya en ajwaka odonyo iye ka ngiyone, wek pe kimok ni jami ducu matye i ot meno obedo keni; lacen ajwaka bidonyo ka ngiyo ot meno. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />En bingiyo puru pa ot meno; ce gin ma puru iot tye i kor ot kun omido ma obedo tworotworo, nyo omido makwarkwar, ka nen ni odonyo matut ikor ot, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />ci ajwaka bikato woko ki i ot meno, cito idogolane, cego dog ot meno woko pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Inino me abirone ajwaka dok dwogo ci neno. Ka gin ma puruni onya omede i kor ot, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />ci ajwaka biciko ni kimuk but ot ma omidoni woko, wek kibolgi woko inge gang i kabedo ma keni. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Dok bimiyo kicwero i ot rumu woko ducu, lobo ma kicwero ki ikor otti kibionyo woko inge gang i kabedo ma keni. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Ka dok kibikelo got apaya mukene, ci kibimwonogi i kabedo ma kikwanyo iye godini, ka dok kibikelo lobo mukene, ci kibipuyu ki ot meno dok kakare.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />Ka gin ma puru otti dok otuc i ot meno, ma onongo dong kityeko muku godi woko, dok kicwero kor ot, ci kipuyu odoco, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />ci ajwaka dok bidok ka nenone. Ka gin ma puruni onya omede i ot meno dok aye, meno lakit gin ma ngunu kor ot; ot meno kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Kibimuku ot meno kireto woko piny, godine ki baone ki lobo ma kipuyu kwede ducu, kibiterogi woko inge gang i kabedo ma keni. <verse eid="LEV 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />Dano ma odonyo i ot meno ma onongo kicego wokoni bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Ka dano ma obutu piny i ot meno bilwoko bongine; dok ngat ma ocamo i otu bilwoko bongine.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />Ento ka ajwaka obino, ongiyo ot ce onongo gin ma puru otti pe onya omede nia inino ma kipuyuni, ci ajwaka bimoko ni ot meno pe keni, pien lakit gin ma puru ioti mo dong peke iot meno. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Pi lonyo ot meno, en bikwanyo lutino winyo aryo kacel ki yat cedar, uci makwar ki anyero. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />En bitwomo pii mamol i otako, ci en bineko winyo acel ki malo iwi pii meno. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />En bimako yat cedar ki anyero ki uci makwar, kacel ki winyo makwo, ci bilutugi i remo winyo ma onongo kineko ki malo iwi pii mamoli, ci kiro ikom ot tyen abiro. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Kitmeno en bilonyo ot ki remo winyo, kacel ki pii mamoli, winyo makwo, yat cedar, anyero ki uci makwari, <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />ci biweko winyo makwoni tuk dok woko i tim inge gang. Kitmeno en bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom ot, ci dano bidok kabedo iot meno.<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />Man aye cik me kwer ma mako two akukuc, two delkom ducu, ki <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />lakit gin ma puru ikom ginaruka nyo ikom ot, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />nyo pi gin ma okwot, nyo orugu, nyo orobo del kom dano, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />pi nyutu ka dano twero gudone onyo pe.”<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Gin ma cwer ikom dano mamiyo dano bedo keni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ki Aron ni, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />“Wuwac bot jo Icrael ni: ka laco mo kome me cone cwer tut, cwer tut meno miyo kome bedo kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Kadi ka kome me cone opong tut, onyo mol tut, nongo kome kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Kitanda ducu ma dano ma kome cwer tut obutu iye bibedo keni, ki gin ducu ma en obedo iye bibedo keni. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Ngat ma ogudu kom kitandane myero olwok bongine, dok bene olwok kome ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Ngat ma obedo ikom gin ma dano ma kome cwer tut obedo iye bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Ngat ma ogudu kom dano ma kome cwer tuti bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Ka ngat ma kome cwer tut ongulu laa ikom dano mo ma kome pe kikeni, danoni bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome ki pii, ci bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Kit kom mo keken me bedo iwi kinaga ma dano ma kome cwer tut obedo iwiye bibedo keni. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Ka ngat ma ogudu gin mo ma en obedo onyo obutu iye, bibedo keni nio wa otyeno; ki ngat ma otingo jami meno bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Ka dano ma kome cwer tut ogudu kom dano mo ma onongo pe olako cinge ki pii, danoni bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Ka dano ma kome cwer tut ogudu kom agulu mo, ci agulune kibineko woko, ki jami macalo weer bao ducu kibilako komgi ki pii.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />Ka dano mo ma onongo kome cwer tut dong ocang woko, ci bikwano nino abiro pi lonyene, ka bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome i pii mamol, ci bedo ma kome pe kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Inino me aborone en bitero amam aryo nyo lutino akuri aryo, bibino inyim Rwot idogola Kema me Rwate, bimiyogi bot ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Ajwaka bityerogi, acel me gitum me bal, acel me gitum awanga. Kitmeno ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome inyim Rwot pi kome ma obedo kacwer tuti.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />Ka laco mo kodine me cone omol ikome, en bilwoko kome ducu ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Ginaruka onyo pyen mo ma kodine me cone omol iye omyero kilwok ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Ka laco obutu ki dako ci gin aryo ducu gibilwoko komgi ki pii, ci gibibedo keni nio wa otyeno.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />Dako ma remo mol ki ikome ikit me kare me kwere ducu bibedo pi nino abiro ma kome kikeni; dano ducu ma ogudu kome bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />Gin ducu ma en obutu iye ikare matye ki kwer bibedo keni, ki gin ducu ma en obedo iye bibedo keni. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Ngat ma ogudu kitandane omyero olwok bongine, dok bene olwok kome ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Ngat ma ogudu kom gin ma en obedo iye bilwoko bongine, wa kome bene ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Kadi bed kitanda nyo gin mo ma en obedo iye, dano ma ogudu bibedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />Ka laco mo obutu kwede, ce kwere ogudu kome, en bibedo keni pi nino abiro, dok kitanda ducu ma danoni obutu iye bibedo keni.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />Ka dako mo remo obedo kamol ki ikome pi nino mapol, ma pe ikare me neno kwere keken, nyo ka remone mol ma okato kare me neno kwere, en bimede bedo keni pi kare ducu ma remone mol; en bibedo keni macalo ikare me neno kwere. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Kitanda ducu ma en obutu iye, ikare me kwere bibedo keni; dok gin ducu ma en obedo iye bibedo keni, macalo ikare me neno kwere. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Ngat ma ogudu jami magi bibedo keni; myero olwok bongine wa kome bene ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno. <verse eid="LEV 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />Ento ka kare me mol pa remone dong ogik, ci en bikwano nino abiro, lacen en bibedo ma kome pe kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Inino me aborone en bitero amam aryo nyo lutino akuri aryo, ci bikelogi bot ajwaka idogola me Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Ajwaka bityero acel me gitum me bal, acel me gitum awanga; kitmeno ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome inyim Rwot pi remone ma omol ma omiyo en obedo keni.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />Myero wumii jo Icrael gugwoke ikom gin ma miyogi bedo keni kitmeno, wek pe guto ma gitye keni pi balo kemana matye ikin gi.<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Man aye cik ma mako laco ma kome cwer tut, onyo kodine me cone omol ki ikome, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />ki dako ikare me neno kwer; ki laco bene ma obutu ki dako ma kome kikeni.”<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nino me kwanyo bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Rwot oloko bot Moses ikare madong awobe pa Aron aryo gutyeko to, pien onongo gunyiko cok inyim Rwot kun gucwinyo mac ma pe opore ci guto woko. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:19">Ibru 6:19</ref></char></note>Ci Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Tit ki omeru Aron ni, pe obed kadonyo nino ducu i Kabedo Maleng ma bongo kicika oumu, inyim kom me kica matye iwi canduk wek pe oto; pien abinen iwi kom me kica i pol. <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:7">Ibru 9:7</ref></char></note>Ento Aron bidonyo i Kabedo Maleng ki wod twon pi gitum me bal, ki nyok romo pi gitum awanga. <verse eid="LEV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />En biruku kanyi maleng me bongo camanini, biruku pali bongo camanini ikome. Bitweyo pyere ki kitambara bongo camanini, ka tweyo kitambara adwala iwiye; man aye bongi aruka maleng. En bilwoko kome ki pii, ka dong birukugi. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Dok en bigamo ki bot lwak jo Icrael nyogi dyegi aryo pi gitum me bal, ki nyok romo acel me gitum awanga.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />Aron bityero twon pi bedo gitum me bal ma otiko en, kun en bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome ki ikom jo ma i ode. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Dok en bikelo dyegi aryonu, biketogi inyim Rwot i dogola Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Ci Aron bibolo kwir ikom nyogi dyegi aryonu, kwir acel pi Rwot ki kwir mukene pi Ajajel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="fk">Ajajel </char> niang telok man ileb Ibru tek; man twero bedo nying cen ma bedo i aroo nyo i tim.</note> <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Aron bikelo dyel ma kwir pa Rwot opoto ikomeni ci bityero me bedo gitum me bal. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Ento dyel ma kwir pa Ajajel opoto ikomeni kibikelo makwo inyim Rwot pi timo gin lakwany bal ikome, wek kicwale woko cen i tim bot Ajajel.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />Aron bityero twon pi bedo gitum me bal ma otiko en kun timo gin lakwany bal ki ikome ki ikom jo ma i ode; en bineko twon pi bedo gitum me bal ma otiko en. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />En bikwanyo atabo weer ma opong ki lodi mac ma okwanyo ki iwi keno tyer ma inyim Rwot me wango odok ma ngwece kur ma kiluru matinotino pong cing aryo, ci bikelone ityelo kama bongo kicika oumuni. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />En bionyo odok ma ngwece kuri imac ma inyim Rwot, wek yito me odok ma ngwece kuri oduny macalo pol oum kom me kica ma bedo iwi Canduk lok me Caden, wek en pe oto. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Ka dok bikwanyo remo twon manok, ci bikiro ki lwet cinge inyim laum kom me kica, dok bikiro remo ki lwet cinge tyen abiro piny inyim kom me kica.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 9:12">Ibru 9:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka man otum, en bineko dyel me gitum me bal ma onongo tye pi lwak, ci kelo remone i tyelo ma bongo kicika oumuni, ci timo remo dyel meno kit ma otimo ki remo twon ca; en bikiro inyim laum kom me kica ki inyim kom me kica. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />En bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom Kabedo Maleng kitmeno, pi keni pa jo Icrael, pi tim aranyigi ki pi balgi ducu. Dok bitimo kitmeno bene ikom kema pien gony man ocung ikin jo ma komgi kikeni. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Ngat mo pe bibedo i Kema me Rwate, cake ikare ma en donyo i Kabedo Maleng katimo gin lakwany bal, nio ka dong okato woko ma otyeko timo gin lakwany bal ki ikome ki ikom jo ma i ode, ki ikom jo Icrael mucoke ducu. <verse eid="LEV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Lacen en bikato woko inyim keno me tyer matye inyim Rwot, ci bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome. En bikwanyo remo twon, ki remo dyel, ci bireyo ikom ten keno angwen me keno tyer, rumu kome ducu. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Ka dok bikiro remo iye ki lwet cinge tyen abiro kun lonyo, kwero doko maleng pi kwanyo keni pa jo Icrael ducu ki ikome.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />Ka en dong otyeko timo gin lakwany bal ki ikom Kabedo Maleng, ki Kema me Rwate, ki keno tyer, ci en bikelo dyel makwo. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Aron biketo cinge aryo ducu iwi dyel, kun tucu ikom dyel man bal ducu ma jo Icrael gutimo, tim aranyigi ki kwayi balgi ducu. En biketogi iwi dyelu, ci cwale woko kwede i tim, kun dano mo madong ki yero aye tero. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Dyel meno bitingo balgi ducu ikome, ci danoni bigonyone woko wek ocit omal i dye tim ata kakene.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 44:19">Eje 44:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lacen Aron dok bidonyo i Kema me Rwate, ci bilunyo bongi camanini ma onongo oruku ikare ma en cito i Kabedo Malengi, ci wekogi kunu. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />En bilwoko kome ki pii i kabedo mo maleng, ka ruku bongine ikome, ci kati woko, tyero gitum awangane, ki gitum awanga pi lwak, ci timo gin lakwany bal ki ikome ki ikom lwak. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Dwolo me gitum awanga en biwango woko iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Ngat ma otero dyel, ocwalo bot Ajajel, bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome ki pii, ka lacen bibino i gony. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:11">Ibru 13:11</ref></char></note>Twon me gitum me bal ki dyel me gitum me bal, ma onongo kitero remogi i Kabedo Maleng katimo gin lakwany bal, kibiterogi woko wa inge gony. Pyengi, ringogi ki wee igi kibiwango woko ki mac. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Ngat ma owango bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome ki pii, ka lacen en bidwogo cen i gony.<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Lev 23:26-32</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Wel 29:7-11</ref></char>
    </note>Man bibedo cik matwal botwu ni, i dwe me abiro, inino dwe apar, wubirii kec wun ki lurok mabedo ikinwu kun wuyube me woro Lubanga. Pe wubitiyo tic mo, kadi anywali me lobo, kadi labedo ma bedo ikinwu. <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Pien inino meno aye kibitimo iye gin lakwany bal ki ikomwu me lonyowu; omyero wubed ma wulonye inyim Rwot ki ikom balwu ducu. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />En aye bibedo botwu ceng Cabit me yweyo mot, ki rii kec. Man aye cik ma bedo matwal. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Ajwaka ma ki wiro ki moo ka kiketo en i dog tice me bedo ajwaka, kun leyo kaka wone, bitimo gin lakwany bal, kun ruku bongi aruka maleng me bongo camanini. <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />En bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom Kabedo Maleng, dok bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom Kema me Rwate ki ikom keno tyer. Ka dok bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikom ajwaki, ki ikom jo ducu mucoke. <verse eid="LEV 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />Man bibedo cik botwu matwal ni, myero kitim gin lakwany bal ki ikom jo Icrael kicel i mwaka acel, pi balgi ducu.” Ci Moses otimo kit ma Rwot ocike kwede.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako kaneko lee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />“Wac bot Aron ki awobene ki bot jo Icrael ducu ni, man aye gin ma Rwot ociko. <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Ka dano mo me ot pa jo Icrael oneko twon nyo latin romo nyo dyel ki i dye gony, nyo ka oneko woko ki inge gony, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />kun pe okelo idogola Kema me Rwate me tyerone wek obed mot pa Rwot inyim kema pa Rwot, ci kibikwano alii me remo iwi dano meno. Pien ooyo remo, kibipoke woko ki ikin lwak pa Lubanga. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Man kiciko wek jo Icrael gucak kelo gitumgi mayam onongo gitumu i dye bari bot ajwaka, i dogola Kema me Rwate, wek kinekgi me bedo gityer me berbedo bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Ajwaka bikiro remone iwi keno tyer pa Rwot i dogola Kema me Rwate, biwango dwolo obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Pe dong wubityero gitumwu bot jogi ma wuworogi ma gubedo calo nyogi oyima ki timgi me kweleni. Man bibedo cik botwu matwal wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu.<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />Ci ibiwaco ki gin ni: dano mo me ot pa jo Icrael, nyo ki ikin lubedo ma bedo ikin gi, ma otyero gitum awanga, nyo gitum mo <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />ma pe okelo idogola Kema me Rwate pi tumu bot Rwot, pe kibiye dano meno ikin lwak ma mera.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kigengo camo remo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 9:4">Aca 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16-23">Nwo 12:16-23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref></char>
    </note>Ka dano mo me ot pa jo Icrael, nyo ki ikin lubedo ma bedo ikin gi, ocamo remo mo, ci abiketo wanga ikom dano meno ma ocamo remoni, dok pe wubiye dano meno ikin lwak ma mera. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:22">Ibru 9:22</ref></char></note>Pien kwo me kom tye i remo; an dong atyeko miyone botwu iwi keno tyer pi kwanyo bal pi tipuwu pien remo aye gin ma kwanyo bal, pi kwo matye iyeni. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />En ma omiyo awaco bot jo Icrael ni, dano mo ikinwu pe ocam remo. <verse eid="LEV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />Dano mo bene ki ikin jo Icrael, nyo ki ikin lubedo ma bedo ikin gi, ma omako lee nyo winyo mo ma kicamo, ka en owoto ka dwar, bionyo remone woko piny i ngom, ci umu woko ki lobo.<verse eid="LEV 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Pien kwo pa ginacweya makwo ducu en aye remone; ma omiyo awaco ki jo Icrael ni: pe wucam remo pa gin mo, pien kwo pa gin makwo ducu en remone; ngat ma ocamo pe kibikwane ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="LEV 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />Dok ka dano mo ocamo gin mo ma oto kene, nyo lee ma nguu omwodo, kadi anywali me lobo, nyo labedo, bilwoko bongine, dok bene bilwoko kome ki pii, ci bedo keni nio wa otyeno, ka dong bedo ma olony. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Ento ka pe olwoko bongine, nyo pe olwoko kome, ci bal bidok iwiye.”<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Juku tim cira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, An a Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Pe wubilubu kit tic pa jo Ejipt kama yam wubedo iyeni; nyo kit pa jo me lobo Kanaan kama atye ka terowu iyeni. Pe wulub cikgi. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Myero wutii gin ma aciko, wumak cika, wulubi. An a Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:29">Nek 9:29</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:9">Eje 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:11-13">20:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:28">Luk 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:5">Rom 10:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:12">Gal 3:12</ref></char></note>Pimeno, wubimako cika ki gin ma angolo ducu, ngat ma bitimo malube ki cika bikwo; An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />Ngat mo pe obed ki wate me butu kwede. An a Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />Pe ibibutu ki meni, pien miyo iketo lewic ikom woru; en aye meni, pe ibiketo lewic ikome. <verse eid="LEV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:11">Lev 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:30">Nwo 22:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:20">27:20</ref></char></note>Pe ibibutu ki ciworu; pe iket lewic ikom woru kumeno. <verse eid="LEV 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:17">Lev 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:22">Nwo 27:22</ref></char></note>Pe i bibedo ki lameru ma nya pa woru nyo nya pa meni, kadi ma kinywalo paco nyo ma kinywalo kamukene. <verse eid="LEV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />Pe ibibutu ki nya pa wodi nyo nya pa nyari, pien miyo ikelo lewic ikomi keni. <verse eid="LEV 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />Pe ibibutu ki nya pa ciworu ma woru aye onywalo, pien en lameru kikome. <verse eid="LEV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:19-20">Lev 20:19-20</ref></char></note>Pe ibibutu ki wayu, pien en wat ma iot pa woru kikome. <verse eid="LEV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />Pe ibibutu ki lamin meni, pien en wat ma i ot pa meni kikome. <verse eid="LEV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />Pe ibibutu ki ciomin woru, pe ibinyiko cok ki dakone, pien en ciomin woru. <verse eid="LEV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:12">Lev 20:12</ref></char></note>Pe ibibutu ki ciwodi, pien en dako pa wodi, pe ibibutu kwede. <verse eid="LEV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:21">Lev 20:21</ref></char></note>Pe ibibutu ki ciomeru, ma omeru aye bedo kwede. <verse eid="LEV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:14">Lev 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:23">Nwo 27:23</ref></char></note>Pe ibibutu ki dako mo, kun ibutu ki nyare bene; pe ibitero nya pa wode, nyo nya pa nyare, me butu kwede. <verse eid="LEV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />Pe ibinyomo yweri me bedo nyek lamine, kun ibutu kwede ma lamine pud kwo.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 20:18">Lev 20:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe ibinyiko cok ki dako me butu kwede ikare ma en tye ki kwer, ma peya olonye. <verse eid="LEV 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref></char></note>Pe ibibutu ki dako pa lawoti, miyo ijere kekeni. <verse eid="LEV 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:1-5">Lev 20:1-5</ref></char></note>Pe ibityero latini mo me awanga ki mac bot jok Molek, pe ibipyedo nying Lubangani kulu; An a Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:13">Lev 20:13</ref></char></note>Pe ibibutu ki laco lawoti macalo ibutu ki dako; meno tim gwok. <verse eid="LEV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:19">Nia 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:15-16">Lev 20:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:21">Nwo 27:21</ref></char></note>Pe ibibutu ki lee miyo ipyede kwede kekeni, kadi dako mo pe opyede ikom lee mo me butu kwede; meno tim kipyeda.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />Pe wupyede kekenwu kitiyo tim cilo magi ducu, pien rok ducu ma atye ka ryemogi woko ki i nyimwuni gubedo ka pyede keken gi kun gitiyo tim cilo magi ducu. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Tim cilogi oweko lobo odoko keni, ci omiyo Rwot oketo can i lobo pi balgi, ci Lubanga oryemogi woko ki i lobogi. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Ento wun myero wumak cika ki lok ducu ma angolo, kun pe wutimo gin mo ikom tim kipyeda magi ducu, kadi anywali me lobo, nyo larok mo mabedo ikinwu. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Pien tim kipyeda meno ducu wegi loboni mayam gukwongo nyimwu, gubedo katimone, ci omiyo lobo odoko keni woko. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Pe wutim tim kipyeda i lobo, wek pe kiryemwu woko ki lobo, macalo con Lubanga oryemo kwede rok ma okwongo nyimwuni. <verse eid="LEV 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />Pe wubiye jo ducu ma gitimo lakit tim kipyeda magi me bedo ikinwu. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />Wumak cik ma acikowu kwede. Pe wunyebe ikit me timo kipyeda macalo jo mayam gukwongo nyimwu gunyebe katimone, pe wuket keni ikomwu kekenwu ki kit tim macalo meno. An a Rwot Lubangawu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ikom bedo jo maleng ki ngolo kop atir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Lev 11:44-45</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:16">1 Pet 1:16</ref></char></note>“Wac bot lwak jo Icrael ducu ni, omyero wubed jo maleng, pien an Rwot Lubangawu aleng. <verse eid="LEV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-12">Nia 20:8-12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-16">Nwo 5:12-16</ref></char></note>Ngat acel acel ma ikinwu owor mine ki wone dok wugwok ceng Cabita ducu; An a Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="LEV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lev 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:23">Nia 20:23</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:17">34:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:15">Nwo 27:15</ref></char></note>Pe wuloke wudok ka woro cal lubangagu, pe bene wutim cal me awora me nyonyo aliya pirwu kenwu. An a Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />Ka wutyero gitum mewu me gityer me berbedo bot Rwot, wubityero ikit mamiyo Lubanga ye gamowu. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Kibicamo ringone inino ma wutumu iye, nyo orwone; ma odong nio wa inino me adeke kibiwango awanga ki mac. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Kace dok pud kicamo inino me adeke, ci bedo gin me kwer; pe dong kibiye gamone. <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Ngat ma ocamoni bal bidok iwiye, pien nongo opyedo gin maleng pa Rwot; dano meno kibiryemo woko ki ikin jo Icrael.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:22">Lev 23:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:19-22">Nwo 24:19-22</ref></char>
    </note>Ka wukayo cam ma ocek i lobowu, pe wuka woko ducu nio wa inget potowu, pe dok wubed ka beko obote ma odong ikare me kac. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Pe wupwon nyig olokwu wugwer ducu, pe bene wucok nyige ma opoto piny i poto olokwu; wubiwekogi pi konyo lucan ki lubedo. An a Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:15-16">Nia 20:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:19-20">Nwo 5:19-20</ref></char>
    </note>Pe wukwal kwo, pe wubwol dano, pe wulok lok goba ikinwu kekenwu. <verse eid="LEV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:7">Nia 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:11">Nwo 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat 5:33</ref></char></note>Pe wukwong kwong inyinga ki goba, mamiyo wupyedo nying Lubangawu. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:14-15">Nwo 24:14-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe ibur lawoti, pe imaa jamine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:13">Pe igale kaculu mucara pa lapakaca mo kadi pi dyewor acel. <verse eid="LEV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:18">Nwo 27:18</ref></char></note>Pe iyet ladingit, pe iket gin mo i yoo ma twomo tyen latowang, ento lwor Lubangani. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:6-8">Nia 23:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:19">Nwo 16:19</ref></char>
    </note>Pe wungol kop alenga; pe idwor kor lacan, pe idwor dano madit, ento ngol kop atir ikom lawoti. <verse eid="LEV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />Pe ibed kawire ikin lutuwu ka kwoto nyinggi, pe ikel lok mo makelo to ikom lawoti. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe ikwer lawoti ki i cwinyi, ento juk lawoti ajuka, wek bale pe odok iwii. <verse eid="LEV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:43">Mat 5:43</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:19">19:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:39">22:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:31">Mar 12:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:27">Luk 10:27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:14">Gal 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:8">Yak 2:8</ref></char></note>Pe icul kwor, pe ibed ki akeca ikom ngat mo; ento mar lawoti macalo imare keni. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 22:9-11">Nwo 22:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wumak cika. Pe iwek leeni onywal ki kit lee mukene ma kite pat; pe ico kit kodi aryo mapatpat i poto acel; pe iruk bongo ma kicweyo ki kit uci aryo mapatpat.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />Ka laco mo obutu ki dako ma angeca ma ngat mukene mito nyomo, ma peya kikoko nyo peya kigonyo woko ki i opii, kibilaro kope ento pe kibinekogi, pien dako onongo pe lone kene. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Laco bikelo gitum me aliine bot Rwot i dogola Kema me Rwate, nyok romo me gitum me tingo alii. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Ajwaka bitimo gin lakwany bal ki ikome inyim Rwot ki nyok romo me gitum me tingo alii, pi bal ma en otimoni, ci Lubanga biweko bale.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />Ka dong wuo i lobonu, ce wupito iye kwayi yadi ducu me acama, myero wunge ni kijuku ni nyige peya kicamo; kibijukuwu camone pi mwaka adek. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />I mwaka me angwene nyige ducu bibedo maleng, kibityero me miyo pwoc bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Ento i mwaka me abice wutwero camo nyige, wek yadiwu gunyak ki wun nyiggi madwong. An a Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 9:4">Aca 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16-23">Nwo 12:16-23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10">18:10</ref></char>
    </note>Pe wucam ringo mo matye ki remo ikome. Pe wutyet tyet, pe wubed luyer war. <verse eid="LEV 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:5">Lev 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:1">Nwo 14:1</ref></char></note>Pe wuko yer te wiwu, pe wulyel teng yer tikwu. <verse eid="LEV 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />Pe wugor komwu pi kwero cola, pe wuked kedo mo ikomwu. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:17">Nwo 23:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pe imii nyari odok lapyeda pi timo tim kwele, weko lobo bale woko ki tim kwele, bimiyo lobo pong ki tim kipyeda. <verse eid="LEV 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:2">Lev 26:2</ref></char></note>Wugwok ceng Cabita, wuwor kabedona maleng. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:11">Nwo 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:3">1 Cam 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:4">2 Luk 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:19">Ica 8:19</ref></char>
    </note>Pe wuloke wudok bot lukor tipu ki megi jogi, pe wucit ka yenyogi, miyo wupyede kekenwu pi gin. An a Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />Mii woro ki dano ma wiye obuk lwar, wor dano madong guti, dok ilwor Lubangani. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:21">Nia 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:17-18">Nwo 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:19">27:19</ref></char>
    </note>Ka labedo mo obedo kwedi i lobowu, pe wutime marac. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Labedo ma obedo kwedwu bibedo macalo latin anywali ikinwu, ibimare macalo imare keni; pien wun bene yam wubedo lubedo i lobo Ejipt. An a Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 25:13-16">Nwo 25:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:10">Car 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 45:10">Eje 45:10</ref></char>
    </note>Pe wutim rac i ngolo kop, nyo i pimo bor me gin mo, nyo peke, nyo dite. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Wubed ki lapim ma pimo kakare, kidi lapim pek ma oromo kakare, aduku lapim ma oromo kakare ki agulu lapim moo ma oromo kakare. An a Rwot Lubangawu ma con akwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="LEV 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />Wugwok cika ki gin ma aciko ducu, wucobgi kakare. An a Rwot.”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Pwod pi turu cik mapatpat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />“Wac bot luicrael ni, dano mo ma ikin jo Icrael, nyo labedo ma bedo ikin jo Icrael, ma omiyo latine mo bot jok Molek kibineko woko; lwak gibicele woko ki got. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />An ki koma abiketo pwod ikom dano meno, abimiyo kibiryemo dano meno woko ki ikin jona, pien omiyo latine bot jok Molek, kun nongo obalo kwede kabedona maleng, dok opyedo nyinga maleng. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Ka lwak pe guyabo wangi ikom dano meno kun en miyo latine mo bot Molek, ce pe gumedo ki neko en, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />ci an ki koma abiketo pwod ikom dano meno ki ikom dogolane dok abimiyo kiryemo dano meno woko ki ikin jona, en kacel ki jo ducu ma gilube pi woro jok Molek.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />Ka dano mo oloke odok bot lukor tipu ki megi jogi kun gilubugi, ci abiketo pwod ikom dano meno, abimiyo kibiryemo dano meno woko ki ikin jona. <verse eid="LEV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Wulonye kekenwu wubed maleng, pien An a Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Wugwok cika wucobgi, pien An a Rwot ma alonyowu wudoko maleng. <verse eid="LEV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Nia 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mat 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mar 7:10</ref></char></note>Dano mo ma oceno wone nyo mine kibineko woko; en otyeko ceno wone nyo mine, remone dok iwiye.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Nia 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:20">Lev 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Nwo 5:18</ref></char>
    </note>Ka laco mo otimo abor ki dako pa lawote, laco ki dako ma gutimo abori kibinekogi woko. <verse eid="LEV 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lev 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:30">Nwo 22:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:20">27:20</ref></char></note>Laco ma obutu ki ciwone, nongo oketo lewic ikom wone; kibineko gin aryo ducu, remogi dok iwigi. <verse eid="LEV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:15">Lev 18:15</ref></char></note>Ka laco mo obutu ki ciwode, kibineko gin aryo ducu, pien gutimo kir, remogi dok iwigi. <verse eid="LEV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:22">Lev 18:22</ref></char></note>Ka laco mo obutu ki laco lawote macalo dako, nongo gin aryo ducu gutimo gwok, kibinekogi woko, remogi dok iwigi. <verse eid="LEV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:17">Lev 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:23">Nwo 27:23</ref></char></note>Ka laco mo onyomo dako ci ododo ki butu ki mine bene, meno kipyeda; kibiwangogi woko ki mac, en ki mon aryonu ducu, wek kipyeda pe obed ikinwu. <verse eid="LEV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:19">Nia 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:23">Lev 18:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:21">Nwo 27:21</ref></char></note>Ka laco mo obutu ki lee, kibineko woko, dok wubineko lee meno bene. <verse eid="LEV 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />Ka dako mo obutu ki lee, ci wubineko dakonu ki lee meno kibinekogi woko, remogi dok iwigi.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:9">Lev 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:22">Nwo 27:22</ref></char>
    </note>Ka laco mo okwanyo lamine, kun nya pa wone nyo nya pa mine, ce obutu kwede macalo dakone, meno lok me lewic atika kibinegogi woko ki ikin lutugi. En obedo ki lamine, bal bidok iwiye. <verse eid="LEV 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:19">Lev 18:19</ref></char></note>Ka laco mo obutu ki dako matye kaneno kwere, nongo en pe oworo remo pa dako ma cwer, dako bene nongo lewic pe omako pi remone ma cweri; gin aryo ducu kibiryemogi woko ki ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="LEV 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:12-14">Lev 18:12-14</ref></char></note>Pe ibut ki lamin meni nyo lamin woru, pien meno nongo ipyede ikom watti; kibimiyo pwod ikom gin aryo ducu. <verse eid="LEV 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />Ka laco mo obutu ki ciomin wone, meno nongo oketo lewic ikom omin wone; balgi bidok iwigi, gibito labongo latin mo. <verse eid="LEV 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lev 18:16</ref></char></note>Ka laco mo obutu ki ciomine, meno otimo kir; nongo okelo lewic ikom omine; gibito labongo latin mo.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />Pimeno wumak cika ducu, ki gin ma angolo ducu, wucobgi, wek pe aryemwu woko ki i lobo ma atye katerowu iyeni. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Wun pe wulub kit pa lurok ma atye ka ryemogi woko ki i nyimwuni; pien gin gutimo gin magi ducu, ma omiyo iya okwerogi woko. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Ento atyeko waco botwu ni, ‘Wubileyo lobogi, abimiyo botwu me bedo mewu, lobo ma miu maceko cam mapol.’ An a Rwot Lubangawu ma apokowu woko ki ikom rok mukene. <verse eid="LEV 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />Ma omiyo myero wupok kin lee ma cik ye ki lee makeni, ki ikin winyo makeni ki winyo ma cik ye. Pe wubale wudok gin me kwer pi lee, nyo pi winyo, nyo pi gin mo ma core iwi lobo, ma an dong atyeko pokone woko pat, ni obed keni botwu. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Wubed jo maleng pira, pien an Rwot aleng, dok atyeko pokowu woko ki ikom rok mukene ducu, wek wubed jona.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />Laco nyo dako mo ma lakor tipu nyo ma min jok kibineko woko; kibicelo woko ki got, remogi bidok iwigi.”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ajwaki myero gubed jo maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Lok ki ajwaki ma gin awobe pa Aron, iwac botgi ni; ngati mo ikin gi pe obale odok keni pi gudu kom dano ma oto ma ikin lutugi, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />nikwanyo ka obedo mine, wone, wode, nyare, omine; <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />nyo lamine ma bedo i ode ma peya kinyomo. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Laco pe bibale me doko keni pi dano ma oto i dog ot ma en onyomo iye, meno kelo cac ikome. <verse eid="LEV 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:27-28">Lev 19:27-28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:1">Nwo 14:1</ref></char></note>Ajwaki pe gulyel yer wigi, pe gulyel teng yer tikgi, pe gibigwero komgi pi kumu pi to. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Gin bibedo jo maleng pi Lubangagi, pe guket cac inying Lubangagi, pien gin aye gityero gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot, en cam pa Lubangagi; pimeno myero gubed jo maleng. <verse eid="LEV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Ajwaka pe binyomo dako ma lakwele, nyo nyako madong otyeko butu ki laco. Gin pe gunyom dako ma cware oryemo pien ajwaka en dano maleng bot Lubangane. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Wubitero ajwaki ni gin jo maleng pi ticgi, pien gin tyero cam pa Lubangawu; gin bibedo maleng botwu, pien An a Rwot, an ma alonyowu maleng, an aleng. <verse eid="LEV 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />Ka nya pa ajwaka mo odoko lakwele, nongo okelo nyero ki cac ikom wone; kibiwange woko ki mac.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />Ajwaka madit ikin utmegine, ma en aye kionyo moo wir iwiye, ka onongo kidyere wek oruk bongi aruka me tice, pe biweko yer wiye oket ata lijayi, dok bene pe biyeco ginarukane pi kumu pi lato. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />En bene pe bidonyo i ot kama kom dano ma oto tye iye, pe bibale me doko keni, kadi bed pi wone nyo mine. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Pe bikato woko nia ki i Kabedo Maleng, wek pe opyed Kabedo Maleng pa Lubangane, pien moo wir mayam kidyere kwede bot Lubangane tye iwiye. An a Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />En myero onyom nyako ma peya ongeyo laco. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Pe onyom dato, nyo dako ma cware oryemo, nyo nyako madong obutu ki laco, nyo nyako ma lakwele; en onyom anyira tugi ma peya ongeyo laco, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />wek pe opyede ikom lutinone ikin lutugi; pien An a Rwot ma alonye obed maleng.”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Rwot ociko Moses kun waconi, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Wac bot Aron ni, ikare pa likwayowu ducu, lakwaru mo ma kome kimwonyo pe onyik cok katyero cam pa Lubangane. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Pien dano ma kome kimwonyo pe binyiko cok bota: latowang, langolo, ngat ma wange ki poyo, ngat ma tyene nyo bade tungcel langabu, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />ngat ma tyene nyo ma bade otur, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />dano ma kore orunge, dano ma oran, nyo ma wange ocor, dano ma twoyo gwinyu nyo nyac, nyo ma kikolo mane. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Dano mo ma kome kimwonyo ikin likwayo pa ajwaka Aron pe binyiko cok ka tyero cam bot Lubangane. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />En twero camo cam maleng makato ki kit cam maleng ducu ma kityero bot Lubangane, <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />ento pe binyiko cok ki bongo kicika, dok bene pe bibino cok ki keno tyer, pien kome kimwonyo, wek pe opyed kabedona ducu malengi, pien An a Rwot ma alonyogi gubed maleng.” <verse eid="LEV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Moses oloko kitmeno bot Aron ki awobene ki bot jo Icrael ducu.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Gityer omyero obed maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“Tit ki Aron ki awobene ni omyero gugwoke ikom gityer maleng pa jo Icrael ma gudyero bota, wek pe gupyed nyinga malengi. An a Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Ikare pa likwayowu ducu, ka ngat mo ma ikin likwayowu onyiko cok ki gin maleng ma jo Icrael gudyero bot Rwoti ma kun kome kikeni, dano meno dong pe bitic i keno tyer. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />Dano mo ikin likwayo pa Aron ma ladobo, nyo ma kome cwer tut, pe ocam gin maleng nio ka kome ocang. Ajwaka mo keken bidoko keni pi gudu kom dano ma oto, nyo ka kodine me cone omol ikome, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />nyo ka ogudu gin ma lakalaka matwero miyo en doko keni, nyo ka ogudu dano ma kenine twero kobo ikome, nyo kwayi gin mo matwero miyo en doko keni. <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />Ajwaka mo keken ma ogudu gin macalo meno bibedo keni nio wa otyeno, dok pe bicamo gin maleng ka peya olwoko kome ki pii. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Ka ceng dong opoto, ci bibedo ma olony, lacen en twero camo gin maleng, pien meno aye cam ma mere. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />En pe ocam geng lee ma oto kene, nyo lee ma nguu oneko, wek pe obale kwede odok keni. An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />Ajwaki ducu gumak gin ma aciko, wek bal pe odok iwigi, mamiyo gibito ka gipyede ikom gin ma aciko; An a Rwot ma alonyogi gubed maleng.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />Dano ata pe ocam gin maleng. Dano ma labedo bot ajwaka, nyo lapakaca, pe ocam gin mo maleng. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Ento ka ajwaka owilo opii ki lim, ma odoko calo gipinye, en twero camo, ki opii ma kinywalogi i ode bene gitwero camo came. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Ka nya pa ajwaka onyome ki laco ma pe a ki i kaka pa ajwaki, ci nyarenu aye pe dong bicamo gin maleng ma kityero. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Ento ka nya pa ajwaka odoko dato, nyo cware oryeme, kun pe tye ki latin mo, ci odwogo iot pa wone macalo yam obedo iye ma pud tidi, ci en twero camo cam pa wone, ento dano ata pe ocam.<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />Ka dano mo ocamo gin mo maleng ma pe ocamo akaka, en bimedo acel me abic ikom wele, ci culu wang gin meno maleng bot ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Ajwaki pe gupyed jami maleng pa jo Icrael ma gityero bot Rwot, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />wek bal ki alii pe odok iwigi pi camo jamigi maleng; pien An a Rwot ma alonyogi gubed maleng.”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“Wac bot Aron ki awobene ki bot jo Icrael ducu ni, ka ngat mo ma i ot pa jo Icrael, nyo labedo mo ma i Icrael, miyo gityer mere, kadi obed me cobo kwong, nyo gityer ma iye opwoyo ma otyero bot Rwot me gitum awanga, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />Lubanga biye gamone ka wubikelo wod twon, nyo nyok romo, nyo nyok dyel ma kome pe kimwonyo. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:1">Nwo 17:1</ref></char></note>Ento pe wutyer gin mo ma kome kimwonyo, pien pe kibiye gamone pirwu. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Ka dano mo okelo gityer me berbedo bot Rwot, pi cobo kwong nyo pi gityer ma iye opwoyo, ma okwanyo ki ikin dyangi, romi nyo dyegi, kibigamo ma komgi becone labongo mwonyo mo. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Lee ma wange oto, nyo ma tyene otur, nyo ma ongol, nyo ma kome cwer tut, nyo ma angoli omako, nyo kit two macalo meno, pe wutyer bot Rwot, pe wumigi me bedo gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Wutwero kelo twon nyo nyok romo ma tyene olot mabor nyo ma cek adunu wek obed gityer ma iwu opwoyo, ento pe kibigamone pi cobo kwong. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Pe wutyer bot Rwot lee mo ma mane obwac, nyo ma kinyoto woko, nyo ma kikayo, nyo ma kikwanyo woko, pe wutum lee ma kitmeno i lobowu. <verse eid="LEV 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />Dok pe wutyer lee mo macalo meno ma wugamo ki bot larok obed cam pa Lubangawu. Pe kibigamogi pirwu, pien komgi kimwonyo pi bal matye ikomgini.”<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Ka kinywalo wod twon, nyo romo, nyo dyel, kong obed bot mine pi nino abiro; nia inino me aborone kibiye gamone me bedo gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Ento pe wubitumu min dyang nyo min romo, nyo min dyel ki latine inino acel. <verse eid="LEV 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />Kace wutumu gityer me pwoc bot Rwot wutum ikit mamiyo kiye gamowu. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Wubicamone inino meno kikome; pe wuwek mo odong nio wa odiko; An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />Kitmeno wugwok cika ducu, wucobgi; An a Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Pe wupyed nyinga maleng, ento jo Icrael myero gunge ni an aleng; An a Rwot ma alonyowu wubed maleng, <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />ma ceng akwanyowu woko ki i lobo Ejipt wek abed Lubangawu. An a Rwot.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s1">Nino madito pa jo Icrael ma kiciko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, magi aye nino madito ma Rwot ocikogi, ma wubitucu pirgi ni gubed gure maleng. <verse eid="LEV 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-10">Nia 20:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:12">23:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 35:2">35:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">Nwo 5:12-14</ref></char></note>Wubitiyo tic nino abicel, ento inino me abirone en ceng Cabit me yweyo mot. Pe wutii iye tic mo i kabedo ducu ma wubibedo iye; pien meno ceng Cabit pa Rwot, en aye gure maleng.<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karama me Kato ki nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi pe iye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Wel 28:16-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />Magi aye nino madito mogo ma Rwot ociko pirgi me gure maleng ma wubikwero i karegi kit ma Rwot ociko. <verse eid="LEV 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Nia 12:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-2">Nwo 16:1-2</ref></char></note>Idwe mukwongo inino dwe apar wiye angwen otyeno, en aye Karama me Kato pa Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:14-20">Nia 12:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:15">23:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:18">34:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3-8">Nwo 16:3-8</ref></char></note>Ikom nino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe acelu en nino madit pa Rwot me Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye; wubicamo Mugati ma Tobi Pe iye pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Ikom nino mukwongone wubibedo iye ki gure maleng; pe wubitiyo iye tic mo. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Ento wubityero gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot pi nino abiro; inino me abirone wubibedo ki gure maleng, pe wubitiyo iye tic mo.”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karama me kac mukwongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ka dong wuo i lobo ma abimiyowu, ka wukayo iye kac, ci wubikelo wic larita cam me wi mwaka bot ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />En bikwato wic larita cam inyim Rwot, wek oye gamowu; ajwaka bikwato inino ma lubu ceng Cabit. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Inino ma wubikwato iye wic laritani, en aye wubityero iye latin nyok romo ma dite romo mwaka acel, ma kome pe kimwonyo, obed gitum awanga bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Gityer me moko kwon ma wutyero kacel kwede bibedo moko kwon mapwote maromo awalkwon aryo, ma kirubu ki moo, ma kibityero kun kiwango ki mac bot Rwot obed gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. Gityer amatane bibedo bwino maromo cupa aryo ki nucu. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Pe wucam mugati, pe wumwod nyig bel ma kicelo nyo manumu, nio wa inino meno kikome, wang ma wukelo gityer pa Lubangawu; meno bibedo cik matwal wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu, ikabedo ducu ma wubibedo iye.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwero Karama me Kac</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Wel 28:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:16">Nia 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:22">34:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-12">Nwo 16:9-12</ref></char>
    </note>Ka dok wubikwano cabit abiro kulu kun wucako ki nino ma lubu cabit, en aye nino ma wutyero iye wic larita cam me gityer akwata. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Wukwan nino pyere abic nio inino ma lubu cabit me abirone, ka dong wucak kelo gityer me moko ngano manyen bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Wubikelo ki ikabedowu mugati aryo me awalkwon aryo ma kitedo ki moko maromo awalkwon aryo; kibitedogi ki moko mapwote ma nongo kirubu iye tobi, gubed wi mwaka ma kityero bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Dok wubikelo lutino romi abiro me mwaka acel acel ma komgi pe kimwonyo ki mugati meno, kacel ki wod twon acel ki nyogi romi aryo. Gibibedo gitum awanga bot Rwot, kacel ki gityer me moko kwon ki gityer amata ma otikogi; gin gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Dok wubityero nyok dyel acel obed gitum me bal, ki lutino nyogi romi aryo me mwaka acel acel gubed gityer me berbedo. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Ajwaka bikwatogi kacel ki mugati me wi mwaka gubed gityer akwata inyim Rwot, kacel ki lutino nyogi romi aryonu; gibibedo maleng bot Rwot, pi ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Inino meno kikome, wubibedo ki gure maleng ma wutito pire kamaleng; pe wutii iye tic mo. Meno bibedo cik matwal wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu, ikabedo ducu ma wubibedo iye.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:9-10">Lev 19:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:19-22">Nwo 24:19-22</ref></char>
    </note>Ka wukayo cam ma ocek i lobowu, pe wuka woko ducu nio wa inget potowu, pe dok wubed ka beko obote ma odong ikare me kac. Wubiwekogi pi konyo lucan ki lubedo. An a Rwot Lubangawu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karama me acaki mwaka manyen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:1-6">Wel 29:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, i dwe me abiro, inino dwe acel, wubikwero iye nino me yweyo mot, nino me po ma kitucu pire ki koko gwara, nino me gure maleng. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Pe wutii iye tic mo, dok wubityero iye gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot.”<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nino madit me kwanyo bal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Wel 29:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 16:29-34">Lev 16:29-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Inino dwe apar me dwe man me abironi en aye bedo nino me kwanyo bal. Bibedo botwu nino me gure maleng; wubibedo i nirii kec inino meno, dok wubityero gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Pe wutii tic mo inino meno, pien en aye nino me kwanyo bal, pi timo gin lakwany bal ki ikomwu inyim Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Ngat ma pe bibedo i nirii kec inino meno pe kibikwano ikin jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Ngat ma bitiyo tic mo inino meno abineko woko wek pe obed ikin lutugi. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Pe wutii iye tic mo; meno bibedo cik matwal wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu, ikabedo ducu ma wubibedo iye. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Meno aye bibedo botwu ceng Cabit me yweyo mot, ci wubibedo i nirii kec, inino dwe abongwen cake otyeno nio wa orwone otyeno en aye wubiywe mot.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karama me bolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:12-40">Wel 29:12-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:13-15">Nwo 16:13-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot dok owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, i mwaka ducu karama me kwero kare me bedo i bolo bicake inino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe me abiro, ci bityeko nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Ikom nino mukwongo wubibedo iye ki gure maleng; pe wutii iye tic mo. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Wubityero gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot pi nino abiro. Inino me aborone wubibedo iye ki gure maleng, ma wubityero iye gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot; meno coke madit me woro Lubanga, pe wutii iye tic mo.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />Magi aye nino madito ma Rwot ociko, ma wubitito ki lwak ni gin aye kare me gure maleng, pi tyero bot Rwot gityer ma kiwango ki mac, gitum awanga, gityer me moko kwon, gitum mukene, ki gityer amata, kun acel acel bedo ki ninone ma otike. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Wubimedo karama magi ikom ceng Cabit pa Rwot me kare ducu, ki ikom mot mewu, ikom gityer mewu ducu me cobo kwong, ki ikom gityerwu ducu ma iwu opwoyo ma wumiyo bot Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />Ikom nino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe me abiro, ka dong wucoko cam ma ocek i lobo, wubikwero nino madito pa Rwot pi nino abiro; nino mukwongo bibedo nino me yweyo mot, ki nino me aborone bene bibedo nino me yweyo mot. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Inino mukwongo wubicoko iye nyig yat mabecone, ki jang otit, ki jang yat ma oluk, ki yat oget ma inget kulu; ci wubibedo ki yomcwiny inyim Rwot Lubangawu pi nino abiro. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Wubikwero nino madito man pa Rwot pi nino abiro mwaka ki mwaka; meno bibedo cik matwal wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu; wubikwerone i dwe me abiro. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Wubibedo i bolo pi nino abiro; lutino anywali ducu ma i Icrael bibedo i bolo, <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />wek likwayowu gunge ni, yam amiyo jo Icrael gubedo i bolo ikare ma akwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt. An a Rwot Lubangawu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Kitmeno Moses otito bot jo Icrael pi nino madito ducu ma Rwot ociko pirgi.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s1">Gwoko tara ma i kema pa Rwot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">Nia 27:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Cik jo Icrael gukel boti moo me nyig jeituni ma kiodo aoda, ci kiliyo maber, me mac tara, wek kiket obed kalyel nino ducu ma pe to. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Aron omyero ocwiny mac olyel jwijwi inyim Rwot nia otyeno nio odiko, ki woko inge bongo kicika ma umu Canduk lok me Caden, i Kema me Rwate; meno bibedo cik matwal wa ikare pa likwayowu ducu. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Aron binenoni tara ma iwi okarmac me jabuni bibedo kalyel maber inyim Rwot jwijwi.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mugati me aketa inyim Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:30">Nia 25:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dok ibikwanyo moko mapwote, ci ibitedo kwede capat apar wiye aryo, kun i capat acel acel bedo iye moko awalkwon aryo. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Ibicanogi ityeng aryo kun iryeyo mugati abicelabicel iwi meja me jabu ma kiliyo maberi. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Ikom tyeng acel acel ibiketo iye odok angwece ma kiliyo maleng, wek obed gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot maka mugatinu. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />I ceng Cabit ducu Aron biryeyogi jwijwi inyim Rwot kun gamo ki bot jo Icrael; en gicike ma bedo matwal. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:4">Mat 12:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:26">Mar 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:4">Luk 6:4</ref></char></note>Mugati bibedo pi Aron ki awobene: gibicamo i kabedo mo maleng, pien en gin maleng makato ma kimiye ki ikin gityer ma kiwango ki mac bot Rwot ma myero kimii bote kare ducu.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lanyut mamako miyo pwod ma opore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Ikare mo wod pa nya jo Icrael mo ma wone onongo Laejipt, okato woko ikin jo Icrael, ci ocako lweny ki dano mo ma Laicrael igony. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Wod pa nya jo Icrael meno ocako yeto nying Lubanga kun ceno bene, ci kitere bot Moses. Nying mine Celomit, nya pa Dibri, ma i kaka pa Dan. <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Ci kikete iot kol, nio ka Rwot binyutu botgi gin ma en mito.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Kel ngat ma oceno cen woko inge gony, jo ducu ma guwinyo loke guket cinggi iwiye, ci wek lwak ducu gucele woko ki got. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Ka dok iwac ki jo Icrael ni, ngat ma ceno Lubangane, bale bidok iwiye. <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Ngat ma yeto nying Rwot kibineko woko; lwak ducu gibicele woko ki got; labedo kacel ki anywali me lobo, ka oyeto Rwot kibineke woko. <verse eid="LEV 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:12">Nia 21:12</ref></char></note>Ngat ma oneko dano kibineke bene. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Ngat ma oneko lee pa lawote biculu acula; kwo kiculu ki kwo. <verse eid="LEV 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />Ka ngat mo oketo ngolo ikom lawote, en bene kibiketo ngolo ikome. <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:23-25">Nia 21:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Nwo 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat 5:38</ref></char></note> Turu cogo kiculu ki turu cogo, wang kiculu ki wang, lak kiculu ki lak; kit macalo oketo ngolo ikom dano mo ni, en bene kibiketo ngolo ikome. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Ngat ma oneko lee biculu acula; ngat ma oneko dano kibineke woko. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:16">Wel 15:16</ref></char></note>Cik bibedo acel pi labedo ki pi anywali me lobo; pien An a Rwot Lubangawu.”<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Ka Moses otyeko lok ki jo Icrael, ci gutero dano ma oceno cen woko inge gony, gucele woko ki got. Kitmeno jo Icrael gutiyo kit ma Rwot ociko ki Moses.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s1">Mwaka me yweyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:10-11">Nia 23:10-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco bot Moses iwi got Cinai ni, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ka dong wuo i lobo ma abimiyowuni, wubimiyo woro bot Rwot kun wuweko lobo biywe i mwaka me abirone ma pe kipuru. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Wubicoyo kodi i potiwu mwaka abicel, wubingolo kin jang olokwu mwaka abicel, wubicoko nyige; <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />ento mwaka me abirone en aye wubiweko lobo ywe mot ma pe kipuru iye pur mo, man aye mwaka ma kidyero bot Rwot; pe wubicoyo kodi i potiwu, pe wubingolo kin jang olokwu. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Gin ma otwi kene i okang pe wubikayo, pe wubicoko nyig olokwu ma pe wungolo kin jange; bibedo mwaka ma lobo ywe iye mot. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Ento wutwero camo gin mo keken ma dongo kene, in, ki opiini, ki angecani, ki lapakacani ki labedo ma bedo boti. <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />Pi lee mewu bene, ki pi lee tim ducu ma gitye i lobowu, gin ma cek iye ducu bedo me acamagi.<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />Dok ibikwano mwaka abiro tyen abiro; ci biromo mwaka pyere angwen wiye abongwen. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Ci ikom nino dwe apar me dwe me abiro; inino me kwanyo bal en aye wubimiyo gwara kok romo lobowu ducu. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Wubikwero mwaka me pyere abice obed maleng, wubitito ni jo ducu gitye agonya i lobo mewu, man aye bibedo kare me jubili, ma nongo ngom ducu ma kijengo kidwoko cen bot rwode ki ngat mo ducu ma ikinwu ma onongo kicato i opii bidok idogolagi. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Mwaka me pyere abice aye bibedo jubili mewu; pe wubicoyo iye kodi, pe wubikayo gin ma otwi kene, pe wubicoko nyig olok ma pe wungolo kin jange. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Pien obedo jubili, bibedo maleng botwu; wubicamo gin ma ocek pire kene.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />I mwaka man me jubilini ngat acel acel ikinwu bidok i dul lobone. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Ka icato lobo mo, nyo ka i wilo lobo mo ki bot Laicrael lawoti, pe wubed ka bune kekenwu. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Ka i wilo ki bot lawoti, wele biporo wel mwaka ma olubu jubili; en bicato boti kun poro wel mwaka ma ibinongo iye cam. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Ka mwaka pud odong mapol, ibimedo wel ma iculu, ka mwaka dong odong manok, ci ibidwoko wele piny, pien gin ma en tye kacato boti en aye mwaka me cam ma bia iye. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Pe wubune kekenwu, ento wulwor Lubangawu; pien An a Rwot Lubangawu.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />Pimeno wubilubu cika, wubigwoko gin ma angolo, wubicobone, wek wubed ma lobo okwe mot. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Pien lobo biceko cam, wubicamo, wubiyeng kwede, ci wubibedo ma piny okwe mot. <verse eid="LEV 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />Kace wubiwaco ni, ‘Wabicamo gin ango mono i mwaka me abironu, kace pe wacoyo kodi, dok pe wacoko camwa ma a iye?’ <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />An abimiyo guma poto ikomwu i mwaka me abicele, wek onyak nyige maromo pi mwaka aryo kulu. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Ka wucoyo kodi i potowu i mwaka me aborone, nongo pud wutye kacamo cam macon ca; nio wa i mwaka me abongwen ikare ma cam dong ocek, kikayo, nongo pud wucamo en macon ca. <verse eid="LEV 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />Lobo pe kibicato me atera woko matwal, pien lobona gira; pien wun wuwelo, dok wun lubedona. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />I lobo ducu ma bibedo mewu wubiye ni rwod ngom okok ngome ma ceng ocatoni.<verse eid="LEV 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />Kace omeru odoko lacan, ce ocato ngome mo ci watgi macok aye ma bibino kakoko ngome meno ma omine ocato wokoni. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Ka dano meno pe tye ki watgi mo matwero kokone, ce en kikome odoko lalonyo, ka onongo gin maromo kokone, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />wek en okwan wel mwaka nia ikare ma ocato, ci ocul dano mayam owiloni wel ma pud odong ca me o i mwaka me jubili, ci ngome bidok i cinge. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Ento ka pe tye ki lim maromo dwokone i cinge, ci ngom ma ocatoni bidong i cing lawilone nio ka mwaka me jubili oromo; kibidwoko ngome ikare me jubili, bidok i cinge.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />Ka dano mo ocato ode matye i taun madit ma kicelo ki cel, en twero kokone ma peya mwaka acel oromo; bibedo ki twer me kokone kadi pi mwaka kulu. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Ento ka ot meno pe kikoko ikine ma peya mwaka acel oromo, ci dong bibedo pa ngat ma owiloni matwal, wa ikare pa likwayone ducu; pe kibidwoko cen ikare me jubili. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Ento odi ma i caro ata ma pe kicelo ki cel ma orumugi kibikwanogi kacel ki poti ma i caro; kitwero kokogi, dok kibidwokogi cen ikare me jubili.<verse eid="LEV 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Lulevi gitye ki twero me koko gangi ma kimiyogi me bedo megi ikare ducu. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Kace ngat mo ikin Lulevi ocato ot mo ma i taun ma kimiyo me bedogi, ce pe kikoko, ci ot ma kicatoni bidok bot rwode ikare me jubili, pien odi ma i taun pa Lulevi obedo jami ma meggi matwal ma kimiyo botgi ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Ento olet ma orumu gangi megi pe kicato; meno lobogi matwal.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 15:7-8">Nwo 15:7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kace omeru ma bedo ka ngeti odoko lacan ma pe twero konye kekene, in ibikonye; en bibedo boti macalo weloni nyo labedo. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Pe igam lim mo me magoba dok pe imed wel bot Laicrael mo, ento lwor Lubangani, wek omeru obed kwo ki ka ngeti. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Nia 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:19-20">Nwo 23:19-20</ref></char></note>Pe ibimiyo en mako banya boti wek inong iye magoba, pe imiye cam wek odwok boti kun medo wiye. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />An a Rwot Lubangawu mayam akwanyowu ki i lobo Ejipt me miyo botwu lobo Kanaan, wek abed Lubangawu.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:2-6">Nia 21:2-6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:12-18">Nwo 15:12-18</ref></char>
    </note>Ka omeru ma bedo ka ngeti odoko lacan, ci ocate boti kekene, pe ibimiyo en tiyo boti macalo opii. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />En bibedo boti macalo lapakaca nyo labedo. En bitic boti nio wa i mwaka me jubili. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Ka lacen en bia woko ki boti, en kacel ki lutinone bene. Bidok cen idogolane, bidok i lobo pa kwarogi. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Pien gin lutica mayam akwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt; pe kibicatogi me bedo opii. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Pe wubiloyogi ki loc magwa, ento wubilworo Lubangawu.<verse eid="LEV 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Ka wumito opii ki angeca; wutwero wilogi ki bot lurok ma orumu ka ngetwuni. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Wutwero wilo ki ikin lubedo ma bedo botwu, dok ki ikin dogolagi ma bedo botwu, ma kinywalogi i lobowu; gibidoko limwu. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Wutwero miyogi bot lutino awobewu ma bilubuwu, gubed ginaleyagi. Wutwero miyogi gibedo opiiwu, ento omegiwu ma jo Icrael pe wubiloyogi kitmeno kun ngat man loyo wadi ki loc magwa.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />Ka welo mo nyo labedo mo matye boti odoko lalonyo, kun omeru matye ka ngete odoko lacan, ci ocate kekene bot welo nyo labedo matye botini, nyo ocate bot wat ma i dogola pa welo meno, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />ka dong otyeko cate, ci kitwero koko; ngat mo ma ikin omege twero koke woko. <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Nyo omin wone nyo latin pa omin wone twero koke, nyo watgi mo ma idogolagi twero koke; nyo ka en odoko lalonyo, ci koke gire kene. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />En bikwano wel kacel ki ngat ma con owilenu, kun cako i mwaka mayam owile iye nio wa i jubili, wel me koke bibedo ma poro wel mwaka; kare ma en obedo kwede bot rwode kibikwano macalo kare pa lapakaca. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Kace mwaka pud odong mapol me o i jubili, en biculu lim me koke, kun lube ki wel lim mayam ki wile kwede. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Ka pud odong mwaka manok me o i mwaka me jubili, en bikwano wel ki dano ma owilenu; ci biculu lim me koke ma oporo wel mwaka me tice ma pud odong. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />En bibedo bot rwode macalo lapakaca ma kiculu mwaka ki mwaka; pe rwode ma labedoni biloye ki loc magwa kun in ineno. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Kace pe gikoke ikit yo meno, ci kibigonye i mwaka me jubili, en kacel ki lutinone bene. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Pien jo Icrael gin aye lutica mayam akwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt. An a Rwot Lubangawu.”<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s1">Gum ma bino pi gwoko cik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Nwo 7:12-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:4">Nia 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:4">Lev 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:8">Nwo 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:21-22">16:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:1">27:1</ref></char>
    </note>“Pe wutim cal lubanga mo keken pirwu, pe wucib cal apaya nyo wir jok mo, pe wucib got mo ma kigoro kome ocung i lobowu pi ryebe inyime, pien An a Rwot Lubangawu. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Wubigwoko ceng Cabita dok wubiworo ot mera maleng; An a Rwot.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:13-15">Nwo 11:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref></char>
    </note> Kace wubibedo ma wulubu cika kun wugwoko gin ma aciko ducu wucobo kakare, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />ci abimiyo kot bicwer i karene kikome, lobo biceko cam, ki yadi ma i poto bene binyako nyiggi. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Camwu bicek atika ma bimiyo kare me kac biromo ki kare me pwono nyig olok, dok pwono nyig olok bene biromo ki kare me coyo kodi. Wubicamo cam romowu dok dong, wubibedo i lobowu ma piny okwe mot. <verse eid="LEV 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />Abimiyo kuc bedo i lobo, wubibutu piny dok dano ma bimiyowu lworo bibedo peke. Abikwanyo nguu woko ki i lobo dok mony mo pe bibedo i lobowu. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Wubiryemo lumerok mewu, ci wubinekogi woko. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Jo abic ki ikomwu biryemo jo miya kulu, jo miya ki ikomwu biryemo jo alip apar; wubineko lumerokwu ducu. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Abiparo pirwu, abimiyo wunywal, wunya, dok abimoko gicikena kwedwu. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Wubicamo cam macon i derowu pi kare malac, wubionyo macone woko wek kabedo odong pi manyene. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Abiyubu kabedona ikinwu, tipu koma pe bikwerowu. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref></char></note>Abibedo kawot ikinwu, abibedo Lubangawu, wun bene wubibedo jona. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />An a Rwot Lubangawu mayam akwanyowu ki i lobo Ejipt wek pe wubed opiigi; aturu rii okol ma kiriyo ingutwu, amiyowu wutire, wuwoto atir.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwod pi dingo me turu cik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Nwo 28:15-68</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />Ento ka pe wubiwinya, ka pe wubilubu cik magi ducu ma aketoni, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />kace wucayo cika, ce iwu okwero gin ma angolo, mamiyo pe wubicobo gin ma aciko ducu, ento wuturu gicikena, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />ci abitimowu kit man: abimiyo lworo poto ikomwu atura, ki kwayi two ma pe cang ma coro wangwu kun balo komwu woko. Dok wubicoyo kodiwu me nono, pien lumerokwu bicamone woko. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Abikwerowu, merok bigoyowu ki inyimgi; jo ma gidagwu aye gibiloyowu; dok wubiringo ata ma kun ngat mo pe ma ryemo korwu. <verse eid="LEV 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />Ka pe wuwinyo loka kadi bed atimo kumeno, ci abimede ki keto can ikomwu tyen abiro pi balwu. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Abituro tek me wakewu woko, kot pe bicwer i lobowu, miyo lobo bital matek liking calo nyonyo. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Wubitiyo tic matek nono pien lobowu pe biceko cam, ki yadi bene pe gibinyako nyiggi.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />Ka wun wuketo jemo ikoma, ma pe wuwinyo loka, ci abimede ki kelo two matego ikomwu, maromo lwak balwu tyen abiro. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Dok abicwalo nguu me tim ikinwu, ma bimako lutinowu, ma bityeko lim makwo ma i cingwu, ci bijwikowu wudoko jo manok, wa yoowu birido woko bidoko obur.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />Ka pe wujuke, wudwogo bota pi kit can meno, kun pud wuketo jemo ikoma aye, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />ci an bene abikemowu marac, kun an ki koma aye abipwodowu tyen abiro pi balwu. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Abikelo mony ikomwu me pwodowu pi turu gicikena. Ka wugure i gangwu, ci abicwalo two gemo magwa ikinwu, ci gibimiyowu i cing lumerokwu. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Abikwanyo cam ma wukwo kwede woko, ci weko mon apar gibitedo mugatiwu i keno acel, dok gibipokiwu mugati kun gipimo botwu apima; ka wubicamo, ci pe biyengowu.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />Ento ka inge magi ducu pe wuwinyo loka, ce pud wumede ki jemo ikoma, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />ci an bene abikeme kwedwu malyet, kun anyayo can ikomwu tyen abiro pi balwu. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Wubicamo ringo kom lutino awobewu ki ringo kom anyirawu. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Abituro ka woro jogiwu ma iwi godi, abitongo keno tyerwu ma wuwango iye odok ma ngwece kur, kun abolo komwu ma oto ikom cal lubangawu, ci tipu koma bikwerowu woko. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Abijwero taunwu madito woko ducu, abimiyo kabedowu ducu maleng dong nono, dok pe abijolo gityer awangawu ma wubityero bota. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Abibalo lobowu woko, wek lumerokwu ma bibedo iye gubed ki ur pire. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Abikelo mony ikomwu, abiketowu woko ata ikin lurok. Lobowu bidong nono, dok taunwu madito bene bidong obur.<verse eid="LEV 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Ikare meno lobo binongo yweyo ma oromo pi mwaka ducu ma wubibedo peke iye ma nongo wutye i lobo pa lumerokwu; kun nongo tye kakwero karene me yweyo mot macalo i mwaka me yweyo. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Pi kare ducu ma nongo lobo pud odong nononi, lobo biywe pien wun yam pe wumiyo lobo oywe ikare ma onongo wun wubedo iye. <verse eid="LEV 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />Jo ma ikinwu ma bidong makwo i lobo ma lumerokwu biterowu iyeni, abicwalo lworo i cwinygi miyo gibiringo dwon pot oboke keken ma yamo yengo. Gibiringo macalo ngat ma ringo mony, ci gibipoto piny kun ngat mo pe ma ryemo korgi. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Gibiyoke keken gi ngat man ikom lawote, macalo giringo ngat ma otingo pala lucwan me lweny, kadi bed ngat mo peke ma ryemo korgi, dok pe wubibedo ki twero me cung inyim lumerokwu. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Wubitum woko ki ikin lurok, lobo pa lumerokwu bicamo komwu woko ducu. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Jo ma ikinwu ma bidong, komgi bilwal woko i lobo pa lumerokwu pi bal megi, ki pi bal pa kwarogi bene.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />Ento ka gibitucu balgi ki bal pa kwarogi pi tim roro ma gutimo ikoma, ma gujemo kwede ikoma, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />ma omiyo an bene akemogi marac kun aterogi i lobo pa lumerokgi; ka gugiko jemo i cwinygi, ci gudoko mwol ma guye pwod pi balgi, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:7-8">Aca 17:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3-4">26:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">28:13-14</ref></char></note>ka dong abipo pi gicikena ma acike ki Yakobo ki ma acike ki Icaka ki gicikena ma acike ki Abraim, ka dok abiroco gicikena me miyo lobo bot jona. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Ento lobo kong bidong nono wek kong oywe mot ma dano pe iye. Ci gibiculu ka wang balgi, pien gubedo kacayo gin ma aciko, dok gukwero lubu cika. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Ento kadi bed kumeno, ka pud nongo gitye i lobo pa lumerokgi, pe abijalogi, dok tipu koma pe bikwerogi maromo miyo atyekogi woko liweng kun aturu gicikena kwedgi, pien An a Rwot Lubangagi. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Pi gin, abipo pi gicikena ma acike ki kwarogi mayam akwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt ma rok ducu gineno, wek abed Lubangagi. An a Rwot.”<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Magi aye cik ki gin ma Rwot ongolo, ki cik ma en oketo ikin en ki jo Icrael iwi got Cinai ki i dog Moses.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s1">Cik ma mako gin ma kidyero bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“Wac bot jo Icrael ni, ka dano mo okwongo kwong ma pire tek me dyero dano bot Rwot, ce ki mito koko dano meno, <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />ci wel ma kingolo pi laco ma mwaka me dite romo pyere aryo oo wa ipyere abicel bibedo cekel me ryal pyere abic, ma kiporo ki lapim i wel ma kimoko. <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Kace dano meno ma kwong otiko obedo dako, ci ibingolo wel me cekel pyere adek. <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Ka mwaka me dite romo abic o wa ipyere aryo, ibingolo pi laco cekel pyere aryo, pi dako cekel apar. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Kace dite romo dwe acel o wa i mwaka abic, ibingolo cekel me ryal abic pi laco, cekel me ryal adek pi nyako. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Ka mwaka me dite romo pyere abicel nyo makato, ibingolo cekel apar wiye abic pi laco, pi dako apar. <verse eid="LEV 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />Kace dano mo lacan tutwal, ma pe twero miyo wel ma ingole, ci en bitero dano ma kikwongo pireni inyim ajwaka ci ajwaka aye bingole wel, kun lubu gin ma dano ma okwongo kwongu twero nongone.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />Kace kwong otiko lee mo ma kityero me bedo gityer bot Rwot, lee ducu ma kitmeno ma dano miyo bot Rwot bedo pa Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />En pe bilokone woko ki gin mukene, nyo gwenyo loko ki wadi mo, mabere ki marace, nyo marace ki mabere; nyo ka en oloko lee mo ki lee wadi, ci gin aryo ducu ma kilokogini gibibedo pa Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Kace obedo lee mo ma keni, ma pe kityero me bedo gityer bot Rwot, ci dano meno bitero leenu inyim ajwaka. <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />Ajwaka bingolo wele, kadi leenu ber kadi rac; macalo ajwaka ongolo wele, ci bicung kitmeno. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Ento ka en mito kokone woko, en bimedo acel me abic ikom wele.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />Ka dano mo odyero ode obed maleng bot Rwot, ci ajwaka bingolo wele, ka ber ka rac; ka ajwaka ongolo wele, ci bicung kitmeno. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Kace ngat ma odyero odeni mito kokone woko, en bimedo acel me abic ikom wele ci bidok bote.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />Ka dano mo odyero but lobone bot Rwot ki ikom lobo ma oleyo ki bot kwarone, ci ibingolo wele kun poro kodi ma kitwero coyo iye; ka romo coyo iye kodi cayiri guniya aryo, kibingolo iye cekel me ryal pyere abic. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Ka en odyero potone i mwaka me jubili, ci bicung iwel kikome ma kingolo. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Ento ka odyero potone lacen inge jubili, ajwaka bingolo wel lim ma myero kicul iye kun poro wel mwaka ma pud odong nio i mwaka me jubili, ci wel mayam kingoloni kibidwoko piny. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Kace dano ma odyero potoni mito kokone woko, en bimedo acel me abic ikom wele, ci poto bidok bote. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Ento ka en pe okoko potonu, nyo ka en dok ocato poto woko bot dano mukene, pe dong kibikokone matwal. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Poto meno ka kigonyo i jubili bibedo maleng pi Rwot, macalo poto ma kidyero matwal; ci ajwaka aye dong bibedo rwode.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />Ka odyero poto mo ma owilo awila bot Rwot, ma pe dul lobo ma oleyo ki bot kwarone, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />ci ajwaka bingolo wele nio i mwaka me jubili, ci danoni bimiyo wel ma kingolo inino meno wek obed maleng pi Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Ci i mwaka me jubili poto bidok i cing ngat mayam ki wilo ki boteni, en ngat ma potonu obedo mere kun oleyo ki bot kwarone. <verse eid="LEV 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Wel ducu ma kingolo bilubu ki lapim i wel ma kimoko.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />Ento lutino kayo pa lee, dano pe twero dyero, pien lutino kayo ducu gibedo pa Rwot; kadi bed twon nyo romo, meno pa Rwot gire. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Ka lee ma keni, en biwilone ki boti iwel ma kingolo, kun medo acel me abic iwiye; nyo ka pe kikoko, kibicatone acata iwel ma kingolo.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:14">Wel 18:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ento gin ducu ma onongo kidyero i cing Rwot matwal, kadi bed dano nyo lee nyo poto ma oleyo ki bot kwarone, pe kibicato dok pe kibikokone. Gin ducu ma kidyero i cing Rwot matwal bedo gin maleng makato pi Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Dano moni ma kidyero i cing Rwot matwal, ma myero kinek woko ki ikin dano, pe kitwero kokone; kibineke woko aneka.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:21">Wel 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:22-29">Nwo 14:22-29</ref></char>
    </note>Acel me apar ducu ma oa i lobo, kadi bed kodi ma ocek i poto nyo nyig yat ma onyak, meno jami pa Rwot gire, gin maleng pa Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Ka dano mo mito koko gin mo ikom gin me apare, en bimedo dul acel me abic iwiye. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Dul acel me apar pa dyangi ki romi nyo dyegi ducu, lee me apare ducu ikin lee ducu makato ite odo pa lakwat, meno bibedo maleng pi Rwot. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Rwode pe bipenyo ka ber nyo rac, dok pe bikoko kun gwenyo ki wadi mo; ka kiloko, ci gin aryo ducu ma kilokogini gibibedo pi Rwot; pe kibikokogi akoka.”<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Magi aye cik mayam Rwot ociko ki Moses pi jo Icrael ki iwi got Cinai.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>